(2082045, 285321, 29474, '<td valign="top">This seems to have been sharpen too much. And the backgound is too similar in colour to the frog/toad to isolate him/her properly.</td>', 'This seems to have been sharpen too much. And the backgound is too similar in colour to the frog/toad to isolate him/her properly.', '2006-01-25 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
