(2082080, 285684, 43824, '<td valign="top">one of the nicest squirrell shots I have seen. It really evokes an emotion!</td>', 'one of the nicest squirrell shots I have seen. It really evokes an emotion!', '2006-01-25 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
