(2082567, 283218, 7322, '<td valign="top">What am I looking at? I don''t see any wildlife here. Plants aren''t what come to mind when I think of wildlife (I would say plantlife, rather). At any rate, the challenge specified mammals, birds, reptiles, and amphibians. In terms of the overall quality of the photo it is a nice effort but could stand improvement. There really isn''t a strong focal point. By the title I understand it is meant to contrast the rotting log with the sprigs of grass growing on it. Without the title to clue me in, the tiny grass just doesn''t make a strong enough contrast to the log to make a strong visual statement. There is too much surrounding detail to distract, even from the log. What is needed for this type of image is a macro shot (or at least as close as your camera will allow) of one of the tiny blades of grass that includes enough detail about the log to give the idea but no so much that the grass becomes lost in its surroundings.</td>', 'What am I looking at? I don''t see any wildlife here. Plants aren''t what come to mind when I think of wildlife (I would say plantlife, rather). At any rate, the challenge specified mammals, birds, reptiles, and amphibians. In terms of the overall quality of the photo it is a nice effort but could stand improvement. There really isn''t a strong focal point. By the title I understand it is meant to contrast the rotting log with the sprigs of grass growing on it. Without the title to clue me in, the tiny grass just doesn''t make a strong enough contrast to the log to make a strong visual statement. There is too much surrounding detail to distract, even from the log. What is needed for this type of image is a macro shot (or at least as close as your camera will allow) of one of the tiny blades of grass that includes enough detail about the log to give the idea but no so much that the grass becomes lost in its surroundings.', '2006-01-25 11:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082571, 285414, 47117, '<td valign="top">Nice, but domesticated. A DNMC.  To me, not a natural environment of this animal, and clearly the fences depict that.  These animals are hand fed and raised. My score reflects that of a DNMC.</td>', 'Nice, but domesticated. A DNMC.  To me, not a natural environment of this animal, and clearly the fences depict that.  These animals are hand fed and raised. My score reflects that of a DNMC.', '2006-01-25 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
