(2082576, 284904, 47117, '<td valign="top">Insects, and not one of the required list given for the contest. A DNMC and is reflected in my score.</td>', 'Insects, and not one of the required list given for the contest. A DNMC and is reflected in my score.', '2006-01-25 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082580, 284371, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  I find it hard to believe that wild cats or any other huge animal known to be possibly dangerous to man was hunted down for any kind of a shoot that only receives a graphic ribbon.  Seeing these two animals together in this way is also to rare to imagine as being a capture in the wild.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  I find it hard to believe that wild cats or any other huge animal known to be possibly dangerous to man was hunted down for any kind of a shoot that only receives a graphic ribbon.  Seeing these two animals together in this way is also to rare to imagine as being a capture in the wild.', '2006-01-25 11:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082585, 285455, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  Also, lose the frame next time.  It is a distraction.  Nice capture though, but not one I believe meets the guidelines of this challenge.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  Also, lose the frame next time.  It is a distraction.  Nice capture though, but not one I believe meets the guidelines of this challenge.', '2006-01-25 11:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082589, 285438, 7322, '<td valign="top">This needs a tighter crop, and probably a different angle of view, to draw more focus to the main subject. There are a lot of distractions---the duck at the right edge, the gull which we can see through the space b/w the duck''s head and wing, and the gull that we can see peering at us just below the duck''s left wing.</td>', 'This needs a tighter crop, and probably a different angle of view, to draw more focus to the main subject. There are a lot of distractions---the duck at the right edge, the gull which we can see through the space b/w the duck''s head and wing, and the gull that we can see peering at us just below the duck''s left wing.', '2006-01-25 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082597, 285149, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  Nice capture, but certainly not one I can imagine you sought out for the purposes of a graphic ribbon, in the wild, and in their natural environment.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  Nice capture, but certainly not one I can imagine you sought out for the purposes of a graphic ribbon, in the wild, and in their natural environment.', '2006-01-25 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082599, 285410, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic subject. Didn''t you have more time to make sure of your focus though? This just doesn''t look sharp to me. In fact, it kind of looks point-and-shoot, as if not much consideration went into the compostion beyond documenting the scene.</td>', 'Very dramatic subject. Didn''t you have more time to make sure of your focus though? This just doesn''t look sharp to me. In fact, it kind of looks point-and-shoot, as if not much consideration went into the compostion beyond documenting the scene.', '2006-01-25 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082600, 285410, 47117, '<td valign="top">OOF, too grose, and just overall distasteful.  Low score from me.</td>', 'OOF, too grose, and just overall distasteful.  Low score from me.', '2006-01-25 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082601, 285323, 7322, '<td valign="top">Appealing subject and nice tight crop. It''s a bit contrasty for me and I''d like to see her eye.</td>', 'Appealing subject and nice tight crop. It''s a bit contrasty for me and I''d like to see her eye.', '2006-01-25 12:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082604, 285603, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sweet, colorful subject. Nice composition. The focus is lacking, sadly.</td>', 'Sweet, colorful subject. Nice composition. The focus is lacking, sadly.', '2006-01-25 12:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082606, 283150, 47117, '<td valign="top">Far from a natural environment. A DNMC to me.  I don''t include man-made natural environments as part of challenge guideline, even though you may have interpretted it that way.  Also, I don''t believe sharks are mammals or amphibians.</td>', 'Far from a natural environment. A DNMC to me.  I don''t include man-made natural environments as part of challenge guideline, even though you may have interpretted it that way.  Also, I don''t believe sharks are mammals or amphibians.', '2006-01-25 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082608, 285555, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  The animal is too rare and to obscure for me to believe this capture was done in its natural environment.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  The animal is too rare and to obscure for me to believe this capture was done in its natural environment.', '2006-01-25 12:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082609, 283902, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool capure of an interesting subject (not one I see everyday, anyway). A bit lacking in sharpness and clarity of detail for me.</td>', 'Cool capure of an interesting subject (not one I see everyday, anyway). A bit lacking in sharpness and clarity of detail for me.', '2006-01-25 12:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082610, 285402, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.', '2006-01-25 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082613, 283901, 47117, '<td valign="top">This is a domesticated animal, and a DNMC for that reason. My score reflects that.</td>', 'This is a domesticated animal, and a DNMC for that reason. My score reflects that.', '2006-01-25 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082616, 285526, 14212, '<td valign="top">Oops, it''s landing.</td>', 'Oops, it''s landing.', '2006-01-25 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082619, 284646, 47117, '<td valign="top">Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  To capture this moment, with these particular animals, is just to far fetched for me to believe you were able to accomplish within their natural environment.  Nice if you did, but too hard to believe.</td>', 'Given the spirit of the challenge was to capture a shot of wildlife in its natural environment, I find it most difficult to believe that this was done with your entry.  Needless to say my vote on this was very low given those circumstances.  When a photo does not do its best in composition to depict actual challenge guidelines, my stadegy for voting immediately stops and it becomes a DNMC to me.  To capture this moment, with these particular animals, is just to far fetched for me to believe you were able to accomplish within their natural environment.  Nice if you did, but too hard to believe.', '2006-01-25 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082623, 285521, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sweet subject and it''s great that you captured it looking at the camera. This appears oddly lifeless and static to me, though. I think it is the lack of sharpness in the nose and eyes, and the overall washed out quality. It''s a nice capture for a personal keepsake but as a photograph it doesn''t quite have the quality to grab me.</td>', 'Sweet subject and it''s great that you captured it looking at the camera. This appears oddly lifeless and static to me, though. I think it is the lack of sharpness in the nose and eyes, and the overall washed out quality. It''s a nice capture for a personal keepsake but as a photograph it doesn''t quite have the quality to grab me.', '2006-01-25 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082624, 285608, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit contrasty but it''s a cute capture.</td>', 'A bit contrasty but it''s a cute capture.', '2006-01-25 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082650, 285455, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very appealing subject. Unfortunately, this is just too overexposed and contrasty for my taste. I''m wondering if the strong contrast is the result of pushing the levels too far in post-processing in an attempt to boost the lost shadow details. It''s nice as a personal keepsake but IMO this one couldn''t be saved with post-processing. I suggest you try bracketing your exposure next time to compensate for the contrasty lighting which clearly fooled your light meter. I don''t care for the framing at all.</td>', 'Very appealing subject. Unfortunately, this is just too overexposed and contrasty for my taste. I''m wondering if the strong contrast is the result of pushing the levels too far in post-processing in an attempt to boost the lost shadow details. It''s nice as a personal keepsake but IMO this one couldn''t be saved with post-processing. I suggest you try bracketing your exposure next time to compensate for the contrasty lighting which clearly fooled your light meter. I don''t care for the framing at all.', '2006-01-25 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082661, 284420, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Gorgeous color and strong silhouettes. I like that they are staggered in size. The best I''ve seen thus far. This should be a winner.</td>', 'Very nice. Gorgeous color and strong silhouettes. I like that they are staggered in size. The best I''ve seen thus far. This should be a winner.', '2006-01-25 12:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082686, 284914, 7322, '<td valign="top">The main subject looks out of focus and there is too much contrast due to flash lighting. The bird eye is reflecting green or amber from the flash which is as bad as red-eye. While there is some interest in seeing the subject frozen in flight there is just too much quality lost as a result of flash, IMO. From a photo of the same subject that I viewed prior to this, that also suffered from flash lighting, I get the idea that this subject is in a very low-light environment and difficult to capture.</td>', 'The main subject looks out of focus and there is too much contrast due to flash lighting. The bird eye is reflecting green or amber from the flash which is as bad as red-eye. While there is some interest in seeing the subject frozen in flight there is just too much quality lost as a result of flash, IMO. From a photo of the same subject that I viewed prior to this, that also suffered from flash lighting, I get the idea that this subject is in a very low-light environment and difficult to capture.', '2006-01-25 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082718, 285407, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual composition and high contrast, grainy quality of this. Atypical of a nature shot but it works here. Clearly, some thought went into the composition and the creative look of the image. My guess, it will do well with a certain faction of DPC voters (like myself) and fall victim to the majority who will paradoxically see it as ''arty'' yet fail to appreciate the art. Good luck and I hope I''m wrong! :D Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I like the unusual composition and high contrast, grainy quality of this. Atypical of a nature shot but it works here. Clearly, some thought went into the composition and the creative look of the image. My guess, it will do well with a certain faction of DPC voters (like myself) and fall victim to the majority who will paradoxically see it as ''arty'' yet fail to appreciate the art. Good luck and I hope I''m wrong! :D Thanks for sharing.', '2006-01-25 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082723, 284884, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic crop. There could be a touch more of glint in its eye.</td>', 'Very dramatic crop. There could be a touch more of glint in its eye.', '2006-01-25 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082743, 285472, 7322, '<td valign="top">This has an odd gothic quality. I''m not sure that was the intention but I rather like it. There is an overall sameness to the tonal range that I don''t care for, mostly because the wolf is almost lost in its surroundings. There is some interesting play of light in the trees but it isn''t quite strong enough around to create the dramatic contrast between light and dark that seems to be called for here. An interesting entry and I appreciate it.</td>', 'This has an odd gothic quality. I''m not sure that was the intention but I rather like it. There is an overall sameness to the tonal range that I don''t care for, mostly because the wolf is almost lost in its surroundings. There is some interesting play of light in the trees but it isn''t quite strong enough around to create the dramatic contrast between light and dark that seems to be called for here. An interesting entry and I appreciate it.', '2006-01-25 12:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082758, 285592, 7322, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject. This is lacking strong, sharp detail and tonal variation.</td>', 'An interesting subject. This is lacking strong, sharp detail and tonal variation.', '2006-01-25 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082763, 284537, 48032, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture! I love everything about this photo. DOF, low saturation and all.</td>', 'Awesome capture! I love everything about this photo. DOF, low saturation and all.', '2006-01-25 12:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082766, 283133, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think the other bird needed to be cropped out of this shot and I''d like to see more detail in the face. Overall, nice effort.</td>', 'I think the other bird needed to be cropped out of this shot and I''d like to see more detail in the face. Overall, nice effort.', '2006-01-25 12:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082772, 285012, 20337, '<td valign="top">Is it just me (and my computer screen), or is the focus on the neck? Awesome idea.</td>', 'Is it just me (and my computer screen), or is the focus on the neck? Awesome idea.', '2006-01-25 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082774, 285695, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range in the b&amp;w and the bit of grain gives this a gritty, urban edge which your title reinforces. I really like it.</td>', 'Nice tonal range in the b&w and the bit of grain gives this a gritty, urban edge which your title reinforces. I really like it.', '2006-01-25 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082775, 284678, 49480, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...I love the silhouetting and the rays through the clouds.  The angle of the shot really looks cool too.  Very nice...highest I''ve scored so far.</td>', 'Beautiful shot...I love the silhouetting and the rays through the clouds.  The angle of the shot really looks cool too.  Very nice...highest I''ve scored so far.', '2006-01-25 12:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082776, 284598, 7322, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if he had turned to look at the camera but maybe there wasn''t an opportunity.</td>', 'Would have been better if he had turned to look at the camera but maybe there wasn''t an opportunity.', '2006-01-25 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082784, 283901, 20337, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but seems like the subject is a domesticated cat.</td>', 'Great photo, but seems like the subject is a domesticated cat.', '2006-01-25 12:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082785, 285000, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird with a nice background. I like the blue in the distance as it seems to help the red of the duck''s eye really pop. Very pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful bird with a nice background. I like the blue in the distance as it seems to help the red of the duck''s eye really pop. Very pretty.', '2006-01-25 12:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082786, 284926, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice color!</td>', 'Very nice color!', '2006-01-25 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082788, 285433, 49480, '<td valign="top">Exposure is too high...some of the whites are blown out.  Would''ve been better with something to place him somewhere...context if you will.  As it is, there''s nothing grabbing me.</td>', 'Exposure is too high...some of the whites are blown out.  Would''ve been better with something to place him somewhere...context if you will.  As it is, there''s nothing grabbing me.', '2006-01-25 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082789, 283828, 7322, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail. Fun subject.</td>', 'Gorgeous detail. Fun subject.', '2006-01-25 12:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082791, 285745, 49480, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors...nice stopping of motion.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful colors...nice stopping of motion.  Very pretty.', '2006-01-25 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082792, 283901, 7322, '<td valign="top">C''mon...wildlife?</td>', 'C''mon...wildlife?', '2006-01-25 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082794, 285311, 49480, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...would''ve preferred it without the distracting branches in the foreground but they work well with him looking surprised so it doesn''t detract too much.  Nice placement in the shot...I like it.</td>', 'Nicely done...would''ve preferred it without the distracting branches in the foreground but they work well with him looking surprised so it doesn''t detract too much.  Nice placement in the shot...I like it.', '2006-01-25 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082796, 284496, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it is difficult to capture a drably colored bird like this, camauflaged as she is in her environment. You succeeded nicely.</td>', 'I''m sure it is difficult to capture a drably colored bird like this, camauflaged as she is in her environment. You succeeded nicely.', '2006-01-25 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082800, 285731, 49480, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows casted...makes it more interesting than just a squirrel.  Cool shot.  Nice exposure in a difficult shot.  With advanced editing it might have been nice to tone down the highlights on the branch below him since it really directs my attention away from the squirrel.</td>', 'Nice shadows casted...makes it more interesting than just a squirrel.  Cool shot.  Nice exposure in a difficult shot.  With advanced editing it might have been nice to tone down the highlights on the branch below him since it really directs my attention away from the squirrel.', '2006-01-25 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082803, 285131, 49480, '<td valign="top">Really cool...nice reflection.  Interesting how there is no contrast between the sky and the water so there''s just this island and bird in the middle of nothing.  I like it.</td>', 'Really cool...nice reflection.  Interesting how there is no contrast between the sky and the water so there''s just this island and bird in the middle of nothing.  I like it.', '2006-01-25 12:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082809, 283713, 50056, '<td valign="top">I love these birds and you did a great job on this shot.  Usually, I like the sharpness focused in on the eyes/face, but with this, the sharpness on the end of wing gives a 3-D effect.  the blend of red and black against the grey BG is equally appealing!  Good luck, definitely one of my faves!</td>', 'I love these birds and you did a great job on this shot.  Usually, I like the sharpness focused in on the eyes/face, but with this, the sharpness on the end of wing gives a 3-D effect.  the blend of red and black against the grey BG is equally appealing!  Good luck, definitely one of my faves!', '2006-01-25 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082830, 285715, 50056, '<td valign="top">A great catch...especially since my personal "pet pieve" (sp?) is when the waters surface is mucky/speckled and generally unpleasant looking, which ducks and geese seem to be so fond of, making it harder to ever get a decent shot.  You, however have managed an excellent composition.  Aside from the simple elegance of the photo, IMO it is technically excellent, I see no imperfections. Good luck with this entry!</td>', 'A great catch...especially since my personal "pet pieve" (sp?) is when the waters surface is mucky/speckled and generally unpleasant looking, which ducks and geese seem to be so fond of, making it harder to ever get a decent shot.  You, however have managed an excellent composition.  Aside from the simple elegance of the photo, IMO it is technically excellent, I see no imperfections. Good luck with this entry!', '2006-01-25 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082838, 284949, 50056, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I might have preferred a slightly more shallow DOF, but a very nice catch.</td>', 'Very nice.  I might have preferred a slightly more shallow DOF, but a very nice catch.', '2006-01-25 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082842, 285491, 50056, '<td valign="top">LOVE the title (LOL)</td>', 'LOVE the title (LOL)', '2006-01-25 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082844, 285721, 50056, '<td valign="top">Lovely...</td>', 'Lovely...', '2006-01-25 13:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082845, 285304, 7322, '<td valign="top">Your light meter was fooled by the shadows and hence, the main subject is overexposed. I suggest bracketing exposures to avoid this next time you take photos in contrasty lighting. If you can''t do this manually, find your camera''s EV setting and set it at a plus setting. You''ll lose detail in the background but it what you gain in detail in the main subject will make up for this. If you were shooting a subject against a very light background you would try stopping down your exposure. In this case you would lose shadow detail but gain in the midtones and highlights.</td>', 'Your light meter was fooled by the shadows and hence, the main subject is overexposed. I suggest bracketing exposures to avoid this next time you take photos in contrasty lighting. If you can''t do this manually, find your camera''s EV setting and set it at a plus setting. You''ll lose detail in the background but it what you gain in detail in the main subject will make up for this. If you were shooting a subject against a very light background you would try stopping down your exposure. In this case you would lose shadow detail but gain in the midtones and highlights.', '2006-01-25 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082850, 285012, 51122, '<td valign="top">nice photo, i like it.</td>', 'nice photo, i like it.', '2006-01-25 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082852, 284981, 48032, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo! A great candidate for first place!</td>', 'Fantastic photo! A great candidate for first place!', '2006-01-25 13:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082856, 284706, 51122, '<td valign="top">a bit out of focus... or maybe i forgot my glasses. but its nicely composed.</td>', 'a bit out of focus... or maybe i forgot my glasses. but its nicely composed.', '2006-01-25 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082859, 285365, 51122, '<td valign="top">that is so cool!!</td>', 'that is so cool!!', '2006-01-25 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082863, 285698, 51122, '<td valign="top">need a bit more light i would have liked 2 see his eyes.</td>', 'need a bit more light i would have liked 2 see his eyes.', '2006-01-25 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082864, 285715, 51122, '<td valign="top">thas nice i like it</td>', 'thas nice i like it', '2006-01-25 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082865, 283077, 45364, '<td valign="top">too bad it wasn''t looking at you... what kind of deer is this?</td>', 'too bad it wasn''t looking at you... what kind of deer is this?', '2006-01-25 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082868, 285642, 45364, '<td valign="top">cute pic</td>', 'cute pic', '2006-01-25 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082871, 284845, 45364, '<td valign="top">nice close up of this bird (sparrow i believe) the catch light in the eye is nice</td>', 'nice close up of this bird (sparrow i believe) the catch light in the eye is nice', '2006-01-25 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082873, 284143, 45364, '<td valign="top">sweet</td>', 'sweet', '2006-01-25 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082875, 285311, 45364, '<td valign="top">nice shot - he''s well-camoflauged - beautiful</td>', 'nice shot - he''s well-camoflauged - beautiful', '2006-01-25 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082876, 285149, 51122, '<td valign="top">this is actually a cougar but its a nice photo... i like it</td>', 'this is actually a cougar but its a nice photo... i like it', '2006-01-25 13:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082877, 285402, 45364, '<td valign="top">hilarious expression</td>', 'hilarious expression', '2006-01-25 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
