(2084032, 283301, 34659, '<td valign="top">Well this isn''t "just another bird photograph"...  This is beautiful.  Very well done.  Fantastic focus, DOF, &amp; lighting control.  Kudos to you.  10</td>', 'Well this isn''t "just another bird photograph"...  This is beautiful.  Very well done.  Fantastic focus, DOF, & lighting control.  Kudos to you.  10', '2006-01-25 17:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
