(2084138, 285727, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Mostly for unusual (and seemingly natural) capture.  Assuming that is a duck or .. bird, ''whacking'' the rabbit/hare.  Criticism; obviously opportune, so difficult to say ''sharper'' - but even the motion blur is so ''much'' that it is difficult to discern what''s doing the whacking.  Can''t see a head.  This at 640 (even if it meant more ''context''/background if the quality wasn''t there for this crop bigger) likely have helped.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '6 - Mostly for unusual (and seemingly natural) capture.  Assuming that is a duck or .. bird, ''whacking'' the rabbit/hare.  Criticism; obviously opportune, so difficult to say ''sharper'' - but even the motion blur is so ''much'' that it is difficult to discern what''s doing the whacking.  Can''t see a head.  This at 640 (even if it meant more ''context''/background if the quality wasn''t there for this crop bigger) likely have helped.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-01-25 18:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
