(2084196, 283301, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture and ''silhouette''/outline/shape.  Criticism; difficult obviously but ''sharper'', more ''pop'', more definition/stop motion in the wings, make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a crop variation, not sure.</td>', '7 - Nice capture and ''silhouette''/outline/shape.  Criticism; difficult obviously but ''sharper'', more ''pop'', more definition/stop motion in the wings, make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe a crop variation, not sure.', '2006-01-25 18:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
