(2084244, 285406, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Seems good whites/contrast control retaining fairly good detail in the feathers.  Looks like good potential, especially with more ''context''/background.  Criticism; bigger (640 height in this case), tweaking of the colors, especially the beak (difficult with resulting contrast issues in the whites) and a ''glint'' in the eye, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure about the pseudo-''vignetting'', if it is fore bokeh or what, but overall adds a darkness to this shot that makes it need tweaking even more so in my opinion.  Not sure on the crop/composition, but depends what you had to work with.</td>', '5 - Seems good whites/contrast control retaining fairly good detail in the feathers.  Looks like good potential, especially with more ''context''/background.  Criticism; bigger (640 height in this case), tweaking of the colors, especially the beak (difficult with resulting contrast issues in the whites) and a ''glint'' in the eye, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure about the pseudo-''vignetting'', if it is fore bokeh or what, but overall adds a darkness to this shot that makes it need tweaking even more so in my opinion.  Not sure on the crop/composition, but depends what you had to work with.', '2006-01-25 18:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
