(2084668, 284524, 26313, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but the UDO (unidentified distracting object) in the corner really takes away from it. I''m not normally one to complain much about noise (I''d rather see a little noise than have something neat imaged to death), but the noise in the sky is quite noticeable even from a distance.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but the UDO (unidentified distracting object) in the corner really takes away from it. I''m not normally one to complain much about noise (I''d rather see a little noise than have something neat imaged to death), but the noise in the sky is quite noticeable even from a distance.', '2006-01-25 20:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2084670, 284371, 49961, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but wish it had a different title!</td>', 'I like the photo but wish it had a different title!', '2006-01-25 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
