(2084682, 285466, 49447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color &amp; composition, I would have liked to see a little more of it to see that it was still alive but I can see enough green in the background, so it probably was.   8</td>', 'Beautiful color & composition, I would have liked to see a little more of it to see that it was still alive but I can see enough green in the background, so it probably was.   8', '2006-01-25 20:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
