(2084930, 284413, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice capture.  Criticism; even though the ''synchronicity'' and reflections of ''wildlife'' are there, the mirror-like surface of the water/sand with the ''bubbles'' really makes this shot in my opinion.  ''If only'' to get both nice and sharp would have made this much better in my opinion., but difficult, obviously</td>', '6 - Nice capture.  Criticism; even though the ''synchronicity'' and reflections of ''wildlife'' are there, the mirror-like surface of the water/sand with the ''bubbles'' really makes this shot in my opinion.  ''If only'' to get both nice and sharp would have made this much better in my opinion., but difficult, obviously', '2006-01-25 21:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2084935, 285474, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, nice close up</td>', 'Cute shot, nice close up', '2006-01-25 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
