(2084957, 285608, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good capture.  Nice background/bokeh.  Criticism; difficult, but seems the tree/texture of the tree is more dominant than the squirrel.  Depending what you had to work with, possibly the inclusion of a little more ''surrounds'' - making this a little wider, may have given this a little extra, not sure.  An obvious opportunity capture, but still, ''if only'' a fraction sharper on the squirrel making it ''pop'' more, but difficult, especially where the lighting seems to be and the contrast issues, etc.</td>', '6 - Good capture.  Nice background/bokeh.  Criticism; difficult, but seems the tree/texture of the tree is more dominant than the squirrel.  Depending what you had to work with, possibly the inclusion of a little more ''surrounds'' - making this a little wider, may have given this a little extra, not sure.  An obvious opportunity capture, but still, ''if only'' a fraction sharper on the squirrel making it ''pop'' more, but difficult, especially where the lighting seems to be and the contrast issues, etc.', '2006-01-25 21:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
