(2085010, 285698, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Looks like possibly good potential.  Criticism; nudge rotation up on the right, sharper, less contrast (looks like pp issues here), a tweaking of colors and a crop variation (depending what you had to work with) all make this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Looks like possibly good potential.  Criticism; nudge rotation up on the right, sharper, less contrast (looks like pp issues here), a tweaking of colors and a crop variation (depending what you had to work with) all make this better in my opinion.', '2006-01-25 22:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
