(2085043, 285721, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice colors, bokeh/background, composition and capture.  Criticism; ''sharper'' and more ''pop'' - but very difficult I know.</td>', '7 - Very nice colors, bokeh/background, composition and capture.  Criticism; ''sharper'' and more ''pop'' - but very difficult I know.', '2006-01-25 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085044, 285319, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Familiar looking ''mirrored surface''.. Nice composition.  Criticism; difficult, but even ''sharper'', with more ''pop'', make this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a crop variation, depending of course what you had to work with, particularly on the right - more fine tuned to include/exclude that ''bubble''.  Again, ''depending'' what you had to work with, but more space above or below (below perhaps better re the reflections), using the shore/water line too, just for more overall ''balance'', make it better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Familiar looking ''mirrored surface''.. Nice composition.  Criticism; difficult, but even ''sharper'', with more ''pop'', make this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a crop variation, depending of course what you had to work with, particularly on the right - more fine tuned to include/exclude that ''bubble''.  Again, ''depending'' what you had to work with, but more space above or below (below perhaps better re the reflections), using the shore/water line too, just for more overall ''balance'', make it better in my opinion.', '2006-01-25 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085048, 283670, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; bigger (640 height in this case), sharper/better focus on the duck.  Not sure on the frame, especially at this size.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; bigger (640 height in this case), sharper/better focus on the duck.  Not sure on the frame, especially at this size.', '2006-01-25 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085049, 285489, 49447, '<td valign="top">Backgroung doesn''t fit the photo.</td>', 'Backgroung doesn''t fit the photo.', '2006-01-25 22:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085052, 284231, 4793, '<td valign="top">"WOW" a nice sharp portrait of this beautiful bird, good dof</td>', '"WOW" a nice sharp portrait of this beautiful bird, good dof', '2006-01-25 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085053, 285708, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, beautiful birds.</td>', 'This is a great shot, beautiful birds.', '2006-01-25 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085054, 285740, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very good potential.  Nice scene.  Criticism; likely not (and apologies in advance if wrong), but this does look slightly ''crooked'' - the barbed wire fencing ''adds'' to that too, so don''t know.  Depending what you had to work with I think that a crop variation (especially at the fore) to try to give the deer more dominance and ''pop'' (obvious potential contrast issues here in pp), make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Very good potential.  Nice scene.  Criticism; likely not (and apologies in advance if wrong), but this does look slightly ''crooked'' - the barbed wire fencing ''adds'' to that too, so don''t know.  Depending what you had to work with I think that a crop variation (especially at the fore) to try to give the deer more dominance and ''pop'' (obvious potential contrast issues here in pp), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-01-25 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
