(2085272, 284731, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture and colors.  Criticism; this looks slightly ''unnatural'', whether it is pp work, or what not sure, but apologies in advance if wrong.  Sharper/more definition in the butterfly would have made this even better in my opinion.   Possibly a little more space ''around'' the butterfly as well, but not sure as ''works'' as is.  Also, the plant is not lavender, not sure what, maybe liatris, who knows, but your title may be referencing color anyway.</td>', '7 - Nice capture and colors.  Criticism; this looks slightly ''unnatural'', whether it is pp work, or what not sure, but apologies in advance if wrong.  Sharper/more definition in the butterfly would have made this even better in my opinion.   Possibly a little more space ''around'' the butterfly as well, but not sure as ''works'' as is.  Also, the plant is not lavender, not sure what, maybe liatris, who knows, but your title may be referencing color anyway.', '2006-01-25 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
