(2086101, 284238, 37224, '<td valign="top">Well, this one is certainly one of the best in the Challenge Wildlife II. The compositon is wonderful, as the title says "peek-a-boo", you created that effect by composition, which is such great. I love the play of light (which also adds to the peek-a-boo effect) and the droplets of water make it realistic and even more detailed. Great job!</td>', 'Well, this one is certainly one of the best in the Challenge Wildlife II. The compositon is wonderful, as the title says "peek-a-boo", you created that effect by composition, which is such great. I love the play of light (which also adds to the peek-a-boo effect) and the droplets of water make it realistic and even more detailed. Great job!', '2006-01-26 03:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086104, 284997, 5664, '<td valign="top">Best !!!  8</td>', 'Best !!!  8', '2006-01-26 03:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086107, 285542, 37224, '<td valign="top">I can imagine this one sitting in my garden like this (and regret why I didn''t try to photograph any bird here, but I didn''t think of it back then, so yeah). The hard thing with wildlife is to make a good composition: you have to be fast, otherwise it flies away, and you need to have luck with the background; which you had: your background is grey, which contrasts with the bird, and that makes it all even more beautiful. Well done!</td>', 'I can imagine this one sitting in my garden like this (and regret why I didn''t try to photograph any bird here, but I didn''t think of it back then, so yeah). The hard thing with wildlife is to make a good composition: you have to be fast, otherwise it flies away, and you need to have luck with the background; which you had: your background is grey, which contrasts with the bird, and that makes it all even more beautiful. Well done!', '2006-01-26 03:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086112, 283713, 37224, '<td valign="top">Another great bird shot. It''s great that this finch is looking at you. First I wanted to say that it''s too bad that it''s head wasn''t focused, yet I think it adds to the mystery: what does the bird think? Background colours contrast with the finch: wonderful. And I love the composition.</td>', 'Another great bird shot. It''s great that this finch is looking at you. First I wanted to say that it''s too bad that it''s head wasn''t focused, yet I think it adds to the mystery: what does the bird think? Background colours contrast with the finch: wonderful. And I love the composition.', '2006-01-26 03:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086120, 284207, 37224, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a cute photo, yet it has his flaws: first of all, it''s too blurry, I would never submit it, secondly, I don''t like the composition: a bit more space around these cute little creatures would have looked better, thirdly: the background is too dark, I think, it''s a bit hard on the eyes.</td>', 'Well, it''s a cute photo, yet it has his flaws: first of all, it''s too blurry, I would never submit it, secondly, I don''t like the composition: a bit more space around these cute little creatures would have looked better, thirdly: the background is too dark, I think, it''s a bit hard on the eyes.', '2006-01-26 03:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086125, 285040, 37224, '<td valign="top">You have cut of a tentacle: which is a very sad thing, too bad. Cutting of little pieces of persons is a stupid mistake to make as a photographer, mind this in future photographs!</td>', 'You have cut of a tentacle: which is a very sad thing, too bad. Cutting of little pieces of persons is a stupid mistake to make as a photographer, mind this in future photographs!', '2006-01-26 03:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086126, 284420, 37224, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph: I love shadow photographs. This one is great because of the colours: they don''t distract too much from the subjects, well done!</td>', 'Wonderful photograph: I love shadow photographs. This one is great because of the colours: they don''t distract too much from the subjects, well done!', '2006-01-26 03:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086130, 285633, 37224, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of bird photos in this challenge, anyway this one is great! The colours of the background contrast with the bird: that makes it an eye-catcher. The bird is looking up and that makes it so cute, haha.</td>', 'There are a lot of bird photos in this challenge, anyway this one is great! The colours of the background contrast with the bird: that makes it an eye-catcher. The bird is looking up and that makes it so cute, haha.', '2006-01-26 03:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
