(2086137, 284731, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is a magnificent macro - truly great work.  The colour is magical, the composition interesting and it meets the challenge perfectly.  Has to be a 10.</td>', 'This is a magnificent macro - truly great work.  The colour is magical, the composition interesting and it meets the challenge perfectly.  Has to be a 10.', '2006-01-26 03:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
