(2086267, 284720, 44611, '<td valign="top">A shame this is a bit on the small side, the composition is great, I love the b &amp; w treatment and it meets the challenge perfectly.  Good luck but I think the size may lose you some points.</td>', 'A shame this is a bit on the small side, the composition is great, I love the b & w treatment and it meets the challenge perfectly.  Good luck but I think the size may lose you some points.', '2006-01-26 04:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086268, 285232, 50299, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the border overlaping the hindleg of the dear.<br/> <br/>The picture itself is a very nice capture.  You can tell it meets challenge standards because he was on his way out of there, meaning he''s not used to human intrusion in his environment.  Well done there. <br/> <br/>I''m not a fan of the light from the sun hitting the trees in the top of the image, it''s a bit distracting with how strong it is.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the border overlaping the hindleg of the dear. The picture itself is a very nice capture.  You can tell it meets challenge standards because he was on his way out of there, meaning he''s not used to human intrusion in his environment.  Well done there.  I''m not a fan of the light from the sun hitting the trees in the top of the image, it''s a bit distracting with how strong it is.', '2006-01-26 04:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086274, 283805, 44611, '<td valign="top">Super capture - well done and good luck.</td>', 'Super capture - well done and good luck.', '2006-01-26 04:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086276, 285361, 44611, '<td valign="top">Stunning - lovely detail, good backlighting.  No idea whether this is taken au naturel as it were, but I''d be nit-picking to mark it down for that - it is a great wildlife photograph.  Good luck</td>', 'Stunning - lovely detail, good backlighting.  No idea whether this is taken au naturel as it were, but I''d be nit-picking to mark it down for that - it is a great wildlife photograph.  Good luck', '2006-01-26 04:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
