(2086282, 285131, 44611, '<td valign="top">The composition of this, and the reflection are super.  Such a shame that your focus is rather soft as this could have been a magnificent image had it been sharp.</td>', 'The composition of this, and the reflection are super.  Such a shame that your focus is rather soft as this could have been a magnificent image had it been sharp.', '2006-01-26 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
