(2086291, 284945, 44611, '<td valign="top">The bird is beautifully coloured, and I''m sure desperately elusive to photograph.  However, I think I would have tried for a good clear shot of something more ordinary as sadly I really can''t make much out of this as the bird is too deep into the branches.</td>', 'The bird is beautifully coloured, and I''m sure desperately elusive to photograph.  However, I think I would have tried for a good clear shot of something more ordinary as sadly I really can''t make much out of this as the bird is too deep into the branches.', '2006-01-26 05:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086294, 284847, 44611, '<td valign="top">There''s a good concept here I think, that just hasn''t quite worked.  The idea of silhouetting the bird and branch is fine. I think the problem comes from two angles - firstly where the two silhoettes overlap (composition), and secondly the movement of the wings needs to be stopped (focus/exposure) to make this truly work.</td>', 'There''s a good concept here I think, that just hasn''t quite worked.  The idea of silhouetting the bird and branch is fine. I think the problem comes from two angles - firstly where the two silhoettes overlap (composition), and secondly the movement of the wings needs to be stopped (focus/exposure) to make this truly work.', '2006-01-26 05:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2086296, 283150, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is very dark and unclear on my monitor.  I don''t think I will be alone in saying this, so perhaps you need to look at your own monitor calibration.</td>', 'This is very dark and unclear on my monitor.  I don''t think I will be alone in saying this, so perhaps you need to look at your own monitor calibration.', '2006-01-26 05:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
