(2089460, 283828, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Focus looks spot on and nice clarity.  Good composition.  Criticism; not much, mainly the ''chopped foot''.  Perhaps a slightly wider/larger DOF to incorporate the ''mouth'', but obviously lens dependent.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Focus looks spot on and nice clarity.  Good composition.  Criticism; not much, mainly the ''chopped foot''.  Perhaps a slightly wider/larger DOF to incorporate the ''mouth'', but obviously lens dependent.', '2006-01-26 18:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089462, 284943, 32345, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that this will be voted down because of the size, you should use the 640 pixels that we are allowed to use in challenges.</td>', 'I''m afraid that this will be voted down because of the size, you should use the 640 pixels that we are allowed to use in challenges.', '2006-01-26 18:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089490, 285115, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice colors and composition.  Criticism; too soft (whether pp or not) in my opinion, but I realize you may have going for this effect.  Just think it would be a stronger image with more definition in the bird and those water droplets/etc.</td>', '7 - Nice colors and composition.  Criticism; too soft (whether pp or not) in my opinion, but I realize you may have going for this effect.  Just think it would be a stronger image with more definition in the bird and those water droplets/etc.', '2006-01-26 18:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089493, 283990, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; given the background/surrounds/context, I think a more off-centered composition may have worked better here (depending what you had to work with of course).  640, in this case width, would also have likely helped.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; given the background/surrounds/context, I think a more off-centered composition may have worked better here (depending what you had to work with of course).  640, in this case width, would also have likely helped.', '2006-01-26 18:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089505, 285742, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Excellent focus/clarity on and around the eye.  Criticism; depending what you had to work with, perhaps 640 height with this too, bringing in a little more context/more body - the OOF ''nose/snout'' is more dominant here than the eye in my opinion.  The reflection in/on the detracts slightly, but fairly minor.  Color is good.</td>', '7 - Excellent focus/clarity on and around the eye.  Criticism; depending what you had to work with, perhaps 640 height with this too, bringing in a little more context/more body - the OOF ''nose/snout'' is more dominant here than the eye in my opinion.  The reflection in/on the detracts slightly, but fairly minor.  Color is good.', '2006-01-26 18:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089517, 283067, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Mainly for the potential and uniqueness.  Criticism; difficult, would like to say the beak sharp too, but you''d lose the ''eye effect'' - otherwise definitely 640 (in this case height) and perhaps a slight nudge rotation up on the left to ''straighten'' (depending what you had to work with of course), and possibly a little more context incorporated ''somewhere'', but not sure as, ''works'' as is.  Even sharper too on the focal points would also have given this extra.  Good unusual capture.</td>', '6 - Mainly for the potential and uniqueness.  Criticism; difficult, would like to say the beak sharp too, but you''d lose the ''eye effect'' - otherwise definitely 640 (in this case height) and perhaps a slight nudge rotation up on the left to ''straighten'' (depending what you had to work with of course), and possibly a little more context incorporated ''somewhere'', but not sure as, ''works'' as is.  Even sharper too on the focal points would also have given this extra.  Good unusual capture.', '2006-01-26 19:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089518, 285000, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice and in seemingly natural setting.  Criticism; 640, slight focal point variation maybe (seems sharper on the grass in the left), but difficult to discern at this size.  Like the composition.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Very nice and in seemingly natural setting.  Criticism; 640, slight focal point variation maybe (seems sharper on the grass in the left), but difficult to discern at this size.  Like the composition.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-01-26 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089524, 285642, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good and unusual capture/composition.   Criticism; difficult obviously, and ''lens'' dependent mostly, but ''sharper'' and more ''pop'', make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more space (depending what you had of course) on the right, primarily to incorporate ''all whiskers''.</td>', '8 - Good and unusual capture/composition.   Criticism; difficult obviously, and ''lens'' dependent mostly, but ''sharper'' and more ''pop'', make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more space (depending what you had of course) on the right, primarily to incorporate ''all whiskers''.', '2006-01-26 19:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089528, 285702, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture.  Criticism; difficult as obviously opportune and likely from quite a distance, but.. ''sharper'' (which I''m sure you''re well aware), make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, not sure, ''works'' well as is.</td>', '7 - Good capture.  Criticism; difficult as obviously opportune and likely from quite a distance, but.. ''sharper'' (which I''m sure you''re well aware), make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, not sure, ''works'' well as is.', '2006-01-26 19:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089529, 283611, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Colors seem good.  Criticism; difficult to discern whether it is ''blur'' issues here or focus &amp;/or too tightly cropped, resulting in loss of quality.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps trying to incorporate more of the rings/ripples of the water for added effect, and the above mentioned ''sharper''/focal issues, would likely have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Colors seem good.  Criticism; difficult to discern whether it is ''blur'' issues here or focus &/or too tightly cropped, resulting in loss of quality.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps trying to incorporate more of the rings/ripples of the water for added effect, and the above mentioned ''sharper''/focal issues, would likely have made this much better in my opinion.', '2006-01-26 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089532, 284845, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice composition.  Criticism; sharper mainly, more definition.  Looks a little blurred but could be zoom/resizing issues.  Good color.</td>', '7 - Nice composition.  Criticism; sharper mainly, more definition.  Looks a little blurred but could be zoom/resizing issues.  Good color.', '2006-01-26 19:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089558, 285064, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Criticism; not much, the ''snout'' in focus as well, <i>maybe</i> a ''composition'' variation (depending what you had) with a little more space, perhaps on the left to incorporate the other OOF hind leg, not sure.  Like the sharpness and definition in the claws - ''if only'' more of the lizard had the same clarity, make this even better in my opinion, but obviously difficult.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Criticism; not much, the ''snout'' in focus as well, maybe a ''composition'' variation (depending what you had) with a little more space, perhaps on the left to incorporate the other OOF hind leg, not sure.  Like the sharpness and definition in the claws - ''if only'' more of the lizard had the same clarity, make this even better in my opinion, but obviously difficult.', '2006-01-26 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089585, 284495, 51802, '<td valign="top">Shallower DOF would help.  Maybe crop out the person.</td>', 'Shallower DOF would help.  Maybe crop out the person.', '2006-01-26 19:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
