(2093723, 285378, 75713, '<td valign="top">nice shot..... focus is very good ...  It would have been nice to see some light in the eyes but I imagine that would have been very difficult as it is my understanding that the wild ponies are hard to get close to</td>', 'nice shot..... focus is very good ...  It would have been nice to see some light in the eyes but I imagine that would have been very difficult as it is my understanding that the wild ponies are hard to get close to', '2006-01-27 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093726, 283673, 75713, '<td valign="top">nice reflection</td>', 'nice reflection', '2006-01-27 22:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093732, 285644, 75713, '<td valign="top">ohhhhhh what a lovely capture...... the colors, the softness... the sparkle in the eyes... and the background is perfect!</td>', 'ohhhhhh what a lovely capture...... the colors, the softness... the sparkle in the eyes... and the background is perfect!', '2006-01-27 22:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093734, 285693, 75713, '<td valign="top">wonderful title for this little guy</td>', 'wonderful title for this little guy', '2006-01-27 22:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093736, 284731, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has far more than the typical butterfly macro.  I love the textural variations as well as the combination of warm and cool tones. 9</td>', 'This has far more than the typical butterfly macro.  I love the textural variations as well as the combination of warm and cool tones. 9', '2006-01-27 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093740, 285742, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb shallow DOF.  Talk about filling the whole frame!!!!  Good job. 9</td>', 'Superb shallow DOF.  Talk about filling the whole frame!!!!  Good job. 9', '2006-01-27 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093741, 284517, 15711, '<td valign="top">STUNNING! WOW</td>', 'STUNNING! WOW', '2006-01-27 22:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093745, 284439, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and detail.  The DOF is good and I like that he isn''t perfecty centered. The glint in his eye does it for me. 9</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and detail.  The DOF is good and I like that he isn''t perfecty centered. The glint in his eye does it for me. 9', '2006-01-27 22:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093749, 285438, 75713, '<td valign="top">nice.... might be nicer if it were less busy</td>', 'nice.... might be nicer if it were less busy', '2006-01-27 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093751, 285012, 15711, '<td valign="top">Conjures up the Garden of Eden. I like this with the blurred jungle sense in the background. Good DOF</td>', 'Conjures up the Garden of Eden. I like this with the blurred jungle sense in the background. Good DOF', '2006-01-27 22:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093754, 285388, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness of him. Owls "wide eyed" expressions are priceless.  I even like him being dead centered.</td>', 'I love the starkness of him. Owls "wide eyed" expressions are priceless.  I even like him being dead centered.', '2006-01-27 22:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093755, 285466, 75713, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2006-01-27 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093760, 285310, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the blue on blue.  Their softness is appealing and the leading lines of the tide marks in the sand is wonderful.  The more I look at it the more I like it. Bumping up! 10</td>', 'I love the blue on blue.  Their softness is appealing and the leading lines of the tide marks in the sand is wonderful.  The more I look at it the more I like it. Bumping up! 10', '2006-01-27 22:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093765, 285491, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but I love this.  I like the almost straight on view of the long beak and beady eyes.  Nice! 8</td>', 'I don''t know why but I love this.  I like the almost straight on view of the long beak and beady eyes.  Nice! 8', '2006-01-27 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093767, 285024, 75713, '<td valign="top">I just love the background</td>', 'I just love the background', '2006-01-27 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093769, 283805, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice rich blue tones and the white of the wings really bounce off! Good detail and the focus is wonderful. I might like to see a bit more area around him, although this does showcase his feathers well. 8</td>', 'Nice rich blue tones and the white of the wings really bounce off! Good detail and the focus is wonderful. I might like to see a bit more area around him, although this does showcase his feathers well. 8', '2006-01-27 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093776, 284599, 75713, '<td valign="top">blue herons are so pretty and so difficult to get close to.</td>', 'blue herons are so pretty and so difficult to get close to.', '2006-01-27 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093777, 284590, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. Although he''s pretty centered in the shot, the angle from which you see him is appealing. Love the shiny eyes and those whiskers are great!!!</td>', 'This is wonderful. Although he''s pretty centered in the shot, the angle from which you see him is appealing. Love the shiny eyes and those whiskers are great!!!', '2006-01-27 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093786, 283713, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely red against the snow.  What a pretty bird.  I like the detail of his feathers. It''s interesting how the focus is on the body and not the head - I kind of like that. 8</td>', 'Lovely red against the snow.  What a pretty bird.  I like the detail of his feathers. It''s interesting how the focus is on the body and not the head - I kind of like that. 8', '2006-01-27 22:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093789, 285535, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like this shot..... pelicans are such ancient looking birds - the background is reminiscient of old color photographs</td>', 'I like this shot..... pelicans are such ancient looking birds - the background is reminiscient of old color photographs', '2006-01-27 22:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093798, 284136, 75713, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot.....so crisp and the eyes are very expressive. the tonal quality of the background fits perfectly with the image of the cat.</td>', 'A beautiful shot.....so crisp and the eyes are very expressive. the tonal quality of the background fits perfectly with the image of the cat.', '2006-01-27 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093803, 285388, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a great capture...... I really love your choice of B&amp;W - I wonder if a tighter crop wouldn''t showcase the owl more.</td>', 'What a great capture...... I really love your choice of B&W - I wonder if a tighter crop wouldn''t showcase the owl more.', '2006-01-27 23:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
