(2093819, 285603, 1280, '<td valign="top">An Eastern Bluebird?  Nice!</td>', 'An Eastern Bluebird?  Nice!', '2006-01-27 23:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093838, 284084, 75713, '<td valign="top">amazing.... the fact that you got the backlight and still maintained all the details in the shadows - the turtle rocks</td>', 'amazing.... the fact that you got the backlight and still maintained all the details in the shadows - the turtle rocks', '2006-01-27 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093844, 285321, 1280, '<td valign="top">If only he faced you...like 3/4''s so we could see more of his eyes. The texture in the bg is unfortunate for this challenge.  I guess it''s glass.  I don''t disapprove of it, but it would look more natural if you''d smooth it out, blur, etc.  For this challenge, advance editing was permitted so you could have.<br/> <br/>The texture on the frog is wonderful, and so is the colour.  Looks like a beauty and you exposed very well.</td>', 'If only he faced you...like 3/4''s so we could see more of his eyes. The texture in the bg is unfortunate for this challenge.  I guess it''s glass.  I don''t disapprove of it, but it would look more natural if you''d smooth it out, blur, etc.  For this challenge, advance editing was permitted so you could have. The texture on the frog is wonderful, and so is the colour.  Looks like a beauty and you exposed very well.', '2006-01-27 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093850, 284371, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh the expression on Ozzie.  He looks so content, even happy.  Sweet.</td>', 'Oh the expression on Ozzie.  He looks so content, even happy.  Sweet.', '2006-01-27 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093865, 285721, 1280, '<td valign="top">nice picture, good dof, good colour.</td>', 'nice picture, good dof, good colour.', '2006-01-27 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093867, 284420, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!', '2006-01-27 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
