(2094819, 284884, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the crop.  Wish there had been better light on the eyes but understand that''s not something you could control.</td>', 'I like the crop.  Wish there had been better light on the eyes but understand that''s not something you could control.', '2006-01-28 09:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
