(2094829, 284542, 30982, '<td valign="top">The line across the picture is distracting - a different crop would make this a better picture, I think.</td>', 'The line across the picture is distracting - a different crop would make this a better picture, I think.', '2006-01-28 09:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094835, 284080, 45919, '<td valign="top">This photo looks out of focus or had too much editing and thus my low score.<br/> <br/>Idea was good though.</td>', 'This photo looks out of focus or had too much editing and thus my low score. Idea was good though.', '2006-01-28 09:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094843, 283901, 45919, '<td valign="top">This looks like a domestic cat for a challenge that was looking for Wildlife, non-domesticated animals.</td>', 'This looks like a domestic cat for a challenge that was looking for Wildlife, non-domesticated animals.', '2006-01-28 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094844, 285232, 45919, '<td valign="top">The border ruins what is otherwise a nice photo.</td>', 'The border ruins what is otherwise a nice photo.', '2006-01-28 09:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094860, 283757, 39839, '<td valign="top">The title made me laugh...very clever.</td>', 'The title made me laugh...very clever.', '2006-01-28 09:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094889, 285388, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice capture however the owl is a little too central.</td>', 'Nice capture however the owl is a little too central.', '2006-01-28 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094900, 284507, 7743, '<td valign="top">Excellent background and good contrast to the bird. The bird seems a little too central though. 8</td>', 'Excellent background and good contrast to the bird. The bird seems a little too central though. 8', '2006-01-28 10:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2094905, 284878, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice pose however the three bright lines make the koala look like a marionette.  Since this challenge allowed advanced editing, cloning them out would have been an option.</td>', 'Nice pose however the three bright lines make the koala look like a marionette.  Since this challenge allowed advanced editing, cloning them out would have been an option.', '2006-01-28 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095012, 284706, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit on the fuzzy side but the light is good on this shot.</td>', 'A bit on the fuzzy side but the light is good on this shot.', '2006-01-28 10:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095013, 284949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bird.  Love the detail on the wing.  I like the background but would like to see the pic with the background a bit more muted, maybe.</td>', 'Gorgeous bird.  Love the detail on the wing.  I like the background but would like to see the pic with the background a bit more muted, maybe.', '2006-01-28 10:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095017, 285310, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, like the composition of it.  Maybe tone down the brightness in the foreground just slightly to give a bit more attention to the birds.</td>', 'Pretty shot, like the composition of it.  Maybe tone down the brightness in the foreground just slightly to give a bit more attention to the birds.', '2006-01-28 10:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095021, 285428, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see you were trying to get both critters in the same picture, but the duck gets kinda lost.  Need to add a bit more sharpness to bring out your subjects.</td>', 'I can see you were trying to get both critters in the same picture, but the duck gets kinda lost.  Need to add a bit more sharpness to bring out your subjects.', '2006-01-28 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095023, 285745, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous bird!  Nice capture.</td>', 'What a gorgeous bird!  Nice capture.', '2006-01-28 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095025, 284904, 49388, '<td valign="top">Hilarious d(oo)b</td>', 'Hilarious d(oo)b', '2006-01-28 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095027, 285378, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would do a wild pony.  The color works nicely here with the pony''s red-brown against the dull background.</td>', 'I was hoping someone would do a wild pony.  The color works nicely here with the pony''s red-brown against the dull background.', '2006-01-28 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095028, 285698, 45919, '<td valign="top">Pity about the light and shadows</td>', 'Pity about the light and shadows', '2006-01-28 10:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095037, 285318, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the subjects here - I think it''s because the background is a bit too busy.  A shallower DOF may help in this situation.</td>', 'Hard to see the subjects here - I think it''s because the background is a bit too busy.  A shallower DOF may help in this situation.', '2006-01-28 11:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095042, 283611, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good idea - the circular ripples add a nice texture.  Bird needs to be in clearer focus.</td>', 'A good idea - the circular ripples add a nice texture.  Bird needs to be in clearer focus.', '2006-01-28 11:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095043, 285715, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely balanced and a lovely soft feel to this picture.</td>', 'Very nicely balanced and a lovely soft feel to this picture.', '2006-01-28 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095044, 285407, 49388, '<td valign="top">Cant figure out if this one has anything wrong or not. As water is dirty-gray, its pretty normal and so is the birds silhouette. Though as this is in adv. editing, its quite common to crank up the curves and make it shiny like in middle of day.<br/>As it is, this is pretty realistic picture and is capturing that time of a day nicely.</td>', 'Cant figure out if this one has anything wrong or not. As water is dirty-gray, its pretty normal and so is the birds silhouette. Though as this is in adv. editing, its quite common to crank up the curves and make it shiny like in middle of day.As it is, this is pretty realistic picture and is capturing that time of a day nicely.', '2006-01-28 11:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095049, 283881, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute pose.</td>', 'Cute pose.', '2006-01-28 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2095050, 285294, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good pic of an interesting creature!</td>', 'Good pic of an interesting creature!', '2006-01-28 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
