(2095053, 285152, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yuck!  That''s for the critter, not the picture - the picture is nicely done - good detail, nice positioning in the frame.</td>', 'Yuck!  That''s for the critter, not the picture - the picture is nicely done - good detail, nice positioning in the frame.', '2006-01-28 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
