(2096897, 284831, 30049, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job of blurring the background with your exposure/DOF setup.  The bird is well lit and focused.  I guess technically this shot is hitting it pretty much right on.  Something in the subject matter itself that is just "OK".  Many, many, birds in this challenge and to score higher with a common subject is going to take something unique.  JMO.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge, and take care!  ;^)</td>', 'You did a nice job of blurring the background with your exposure/DOF setup.  The bird is well lit and focused.  I guess technically this shot is hitting it pretty much right on.  Something in the subject matter itself that is just "OK".  Many, many, birds in this challenge and to score higher with a common subject is going to take something unique.  JMO. Good luck in the challenge, and take care!  ;^)', '2006-01-29 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
