(2098092, 284620, 46468, '<td valign="top">I like the ducks and the one upside down is great, however due to the photo being so dark I am unable to accurately judge the details, the feather definition, etc. The 2 ducks in the back, it is hard to tell where their heads end and the background starts.</td>', 'I like the ducks and the one upside down is great, however due to the photo being so dark I am unable to accurately judge the details, the feather definition, etc. The 2 ducks in the back, it is hard to tell where their heads end and the background starts.', '2006-01-29 11:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098096, 285428, 46468, '<td valign="top">Cute capture, love that you actually have 2 different animals and they seem to be in the wild. However I would have preferred that I was able to see the whole duck. Also the head of the turtle and the tip of the duck beak are both a little soft, love the red eyes of the turtle though. Still a nice photo and good luck</td>', 'Cute capture, love that you actually have 2 different animals and they seem to be in the wild. However I would have preferred that I was able to see the whole duck. Also the head of the turtle and the tip of the duck beak are both a little soft, love the red eyes of the turtle though. Still a nice photo and good luck', '2006-01-29 11:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098100, 285232, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, love the snow on his head, really tells the story and adds to the picture. IMO, the border doesn''t add much, but I know that is a personal opinion and does not count against your choice to have one. Where the border crosses his back leg is a little distracting, my eyes just keep returning there however. I like the composition and the sunlight on the trees, the focus on the deer head appears just a tiny bit soft. Overall nicely done and good luck</td>', 'Beautiful capture, love the snow on his head, really tells the story and adds to the picture. IMO, the border doesn''t add much, but I know that is a personal opinion and does not count against your choice to have one. Where the border crosses his back leg is a little distracting, my eyes just keep returning there however. I like the composition and the sunlight on the trees, the focus on the deer head appears just a tiny bit soft. Overall nicely done and good luck', '2006-01-29 11:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098105, 284134, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, love the reflection, focus is alright, would love to see just a touch more feather definition but I do realize how hard that is on a white bird-the feathers just seem to blend on white. I like that you can even see his little foot behind him, overall nicely done and good luck</td>', 'Nice capture, love the reflection, focus is alright, would love to see just a touch more feather definition but I do realize how hard that is on a white bird-the feathers just seem to blend on white. I like that you can even see his little foot behind him, overall nicely done and good luck', '2006-01-29 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098114, 283203, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I wish he had been looking into the photo instead of out of it, as that seems to draw my eye out of the picture. Also the highlights are just a tiny bit blown on the backside of both animals, otherwise nicely done photo of a subject that I never get to see in the wild-Good luck</td>', 'Nice capture, I wish he had been looking into the photo instead of out of it, as that seems to draw my eye out of the picture. Also the highlights are just a tiny bit blown on the backside of both animals, otherwise nicely done photo of a subject that I never get to see in the wild-Good luck', '2006-01-29 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098118, 284682, 46468, '<td valign="top">What a great capture, love the action, good use of the rule of thirds-Good luck</td>', 'What a great capture, love the action, good use of the rule of thirds-Good luck', '2006-01-29 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098121, 285719, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-01-29 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098129, 285623, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice DOF, great color, only distraction is the slightly blown spot on the beak. Overall a great capture and good luck</td>', 'Beautiful, nice DOF, great color, only distraction is the slightly blown spot on the beak. Overall a great capture and good luck', '2006-01-29 11:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098140, 283757, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute title to accompany the shot!  I don''t think you could have captured his wings any wider!</td>', 'Cute title to accompany the shot!  I don''t think you could have captured his wings any wider!', '2006-01-29 11:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098142, 284363, 28029, '<td valign="top">Very tough shot to get. Great colors and action. If it had been possible, focus on a foreground duck would have greatly increased the appeal. Nice job.7</td>', 'Very tough shot to get. Great colors and action. If it had been possible, focus on a foreground duck would have greatly increased the appeal. Nice job.7', '2006-01-29 11:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098143, 284732, 28029, '<td valign="top">Nice composition- but the levels need a little work.</td>', 'Nice composition- but the levels need a little work.', '2006-01-29 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098144, 285530, 28029, '<td valign="top">A little less foreground and a little more background would add to the interest, I think</td>', 'A little less foreground and a little more background would add to the interest, I think', '2006-01-29 11:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098145, 285070, 28029, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation. Slightly soft focus. Good job. 7</td>', 'I like the desaturation. Slightly soft focus. Good job. 7', '2006-01-29 11:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
