(2098177, 283670, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful duck, lovely colors, however due to the small size I am unable to see enough details, I can not determine if the focus is sharp, the wing definition, etc. When submitting photos for DPChallenge they should be as large as you can make them and still be within the allowable size. "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels." Your dimensions are 112,625 bytes and 251 x 335 pixels. If you are receiving lower votes then you thought you would receive it is probably due to the size of the picture. It looks like a very nice picture but without the ability to see the details it is hard to judge the quality accurately. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Beautiful duck, lovely colors, however due to the small size I am unable to see enough details, I can not determine if the focus is sharp, the wing definition, etc. When submitting photos for DPChallenge they should be as large as you can make them and still be within the allowable size. "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels." Your dimensions are 112,625 bytes and 251 x 335 pixels. If you are receiving lower votes then you thought you would receive it is probably due to the size of the picture. It looks like a very nice picture but without the ability to see the details it is hard to judge the quality accurately. Hope this helps.', '2006-01-29 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
