(2100021, 285491, 35350, '<td valign="top">wow what creepy eyes, love the compisition</td>', 'wow what creepy eyes, love the compisition', '2006-01-29 23:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100023, 285455, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but you cut the second trunk off with the boarder which hurts your composition a bit.</td>', 'Nice capture, but you cut the second trunk off with the boarder which hurts your composition a bit.', '2006-01-29 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100025, 285152, 16106, '<td valign="top">Yup this is the one, my pick for the top spot. The ivory of the croc and the green of the alge work like magic, witht he strong diagonal of the snout working well with the crop: good DOF provides plenty of detail on the subject while minimising distractions in the backround. It might have benfited by a bit darker blacks to bring up the pop factor, but this is the best of the crop.</td>', 'Yup this is the one, my pick for the top spot. The ivory of the croc and the green of the alge work like magic, witht he strong diagonal of the snout working well with the crop: good DOF provides plenty of detail on the subject while minimising distractions in the backround. It might have benfited by a bit darker blacks to bring up the pop factor, but this is the best of the crop.', '2006-01-29 23:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100027, 285483, 45928, '<td valign="top">A little more light and this would have been a ten, but great shot none the less.</td>', 'A little more light and this would have been a ten, but great shot none the less.', '2006-01-29 23:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100031, 285402, 35350, '<td valign="top">there needs to be a wildlife smile category, this would win it.</td>', 'there needs to be a wildlife smile category, this would win it.', '2006-01-29 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100034, 284524, 16106, '<td valign="top">A rich and lovely abstraction, witht the burst of color in the bottom left providing a textural anchor to the cool blur of motion. This is one of my top three, just a lovely peice.</td>', 'A rich and lovely abstraction, witht the burst of color in the bottom left providing a textural anchor to the cool blur of motion. This is one of my top three, just a lovely peice.', '2006-01-29 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100040, 284080, 48717, '<td valign="top">All i can say is focus, I am sure you are getting that a lot.  Perhaps it is due to the extreme zoom which it seems like you used.  Composition is ok, and it seems like the color captured might have been nice, but it is hard to be sure because the picture is so pixelated.</td>', 'All i can say is focus, I am sure you are getting that a lot.  Perhaps it is due to the extreme zoom which it seems like you used.  Composition is ok, and it seems like the color captured might have been nice, but it is hard to be sure because the picture is so pixelated.', '2006-01-29 23:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100045, 284084, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully capture, well framed and you caught some rich light here. The backround looks a bit muddy and uniform, like an abuse of the highlights and shadows tool, which knocks it down a bit, but it is still a top five.</td>', 'Beautifully capture, well framed and you caught some rich light here. The backround looks a bit muddy and uniform, like an abuse of the highlights and shadows tool, which knocks it down a bit, but it is still a top five.', '2006-01-29 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
