(2100065, 284847, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the silhouette, kinda like a painting. I''m guessing its not scoring well because people can''t "see" it but its a really good piece of art</td>', 'Love the silhouette, kinda like a painting. I''m guessing its not scoring well because people can''t "see" it but its a really good piece of art', '2006-01-29 23:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
