(2100693, 283907, 41574, '<td valign="top">Hot girl, and I like how her bikini-bottom is about to come right off. That said, talk about a horrible excuse for a submission to this challenge. Sorry, but entitling the picture with the word "wild" somewhere in it, doesn''t mean that you actually cared about the challenge''s rules. Try to submit something pertaining to the theme, next time. (Also, it is a nice photograph, per se, but, again, that''s irrelevant.)</td>', 'Hot girl, and I like how her bikini-bottom is about to come right off. That said, talk about a horrible excuse for a submission to this challenge. Sorry, but entitling the picture with the word "wild" somewhere in it, doesn''t mean that you actually cared about the challenge''s rules. Try to submit something pertaining to the theme, next time. (Also, it is a nice photograph, per se, but, again, that''s irrelevant.)', '2006-01-30 02:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100695, 283341, 45928, '<td valign="top">Great shot and color! I only wish there were a little more detail in the background..</td>', 'Great shot and color! I only wish there were a little more detail in the background..', '2006-01-30 02:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100706, 284503, 41574, '<td valign="top">I almost love this photo...but then, I don''t. I suppose, I love what it could have been, and what I desperately want to see in it (serene setting, semi-cinematic feel, sharp focus). It''s still a good shot, but it doesn''t cross the line into "great."</td>', 'I almost love this photo...but then, I don''t. I suppose, I love what it could have been, and what I desperately want to see in it (serene setting, semi-cinematic feel, sharp focus). It''s still a good shot, but it doesn''t cross the line into "great."', '2006-01-30 02:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
