(2100943, 283077, 1647, '<td valign="top">There''s not many shots that work well from behind the animal, but this is one of those exceptions.  Removing the face simplifies the shot and draws attention to those antlers/horns.  I really like this shot.</td>', 'There''s not many shots that work well from behind the animal, but this is one of those exceptions.  Removing the face simplifies the shot and draws attention to those antlers/horns.  I really like this shot.', '2006-01-30 04:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100944, 285318, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s very hard to see the dogs in this shot.  The harsh lighting (ie: direct sun and dark shadow) is very difficult to capture well in digital cameras, but I like the concept behind the shot.</td>', 'It''s very hard to see the dogs in this shot.  The harsh lighting (ie: direct sun and dark shadow) is very difficult to capture well in digital cameras, but I like the concept behind the shot.', '2006-01-30 04:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
