(2103445, 284678, 34539, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2006-01-30 19:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103469, 283907, 11738, '<td valign="top">Compression artifacts along her right thigh.  Her bikini bottom is way too tight.  It''s digging into her left hip/butt, making for an unflattering figure.</td>', 'Compression artifacts along her right thigh.  Her bikini bottom is way too tight.  It''s digging into her left hip/butt, making for an unflattering figure.', '2006-01-30 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103486, 285644, 25464, '<td valign="top">a bit too soft.</td>', 'a bit too soft.', '2006-01-30 20:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103492, 285684, 25464, '<td valign="top">Cute, but a bit overprocessed.</td>', 'Cute, but a bit overprocessed.', '2006-01-30 20:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103494, 284614, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light is hitting the wings.</td>', 'I like the way the light is hitting the wings.', '2006-01-30 20:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103500, 285483, 25464, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice capture but it is a bit small, and could use some color saturation.  I would crop the right and bottom closer to loose the shadow and people on that side and place the subject in the third, and boost the color a tad.</td>', 'Looks like a nice capture but it is a bit small, and could use some color saturation.  I would crop the right and bottom closer to loose the shadow and people on that side and place the subject in the third, and boost the color a tad.', '2006-01-30 20:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103502, 285704, 46020, '<td valign="top">The following comments are meant to be helpful.  I realize that they may sound harsh and even bruise your ego, this is not my intent.  Please accept my apology in advance if I sound too much like Simon Cowell.<br/> <br/>The possums face is not in focus.  It seems only the rear 1/3 of his body has crisp focus.  However, I understand that there was very little light to help you focus.  I doubt I could get as much in focus as you did.  It looks as if this was a very tough shot to get; perhaps you were on your belly to get this great perspective.<br/> <br/>Your post processing could be neater.  You should not burn (make darker) areas of a photo without a selection.  If you had a selection around his eyes, nose and widows peak, your attempts at burning wouldn''t be so apparent.  The post processing of photos is analogous to a woman applying make up.  Both look excellent when you can''t tell either has been used.<br/> <br/>If you are willing to pay for shipping, I have some Photoshop books Id be willing to send you.  PM me if you are interested.<br/> <br/>Good luck in this and future challenges!</td>', 'The following comments are meant to be helpful.  I realize that they may sound harsh and even bruise your ego, this is not my intent.  Please accept my apology in advance if I sound too much like Simon Cowell. The possums face is not in focus.  It seems only the rear 1/3 of his body has crisp focus.  However, I understand that there was very little light to help you focus.  I doubt I could get as much in focus as you did.  It looks as if this was a very tough shot to get; perhaps you were on your belly to get this great perspective. Your post processing could be neater.  You should not burn (make darker) areas of a photo without a selection.  If you had a selection around his eyes, nose and widows peak, your attempts at burning wouldn''t be so apparent.  The post processing of photos is analogous to a woman applying make up.  Both look excellent when you can''t tell either has been used. If you are willing to pay for shipping, I have some Photoshop books Id be willing to send you.  PM me if you are interested. Good luck in this and future challenges!', '2006-01-30 20:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103504, 284878, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very crisp, and getting a shot of this guy with his eyes open, is no easy task.  I think the background illustrates a non-natural setting.  I am sure you will get beat up about that, but it is a very nice shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  Very crisp, and getting a shot of this guy with his eyes open, is no easy task.  I think the background illustrates a non-natural setting.  I am sure you will get beat up about that, but it is a very nice shot.', '2006-01-30 20:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103505, 285433, 25464, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed.</td>', 'A bit overexposed.', '2006-01-30 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103507, 285600, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  Very sharp. Nice catch light.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice color.  Very sharp. Nice catch light.  Good job.', '2006-01-30 20:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103511, 283845, 25464, '<td valign="top">great subject.  If you could have put a little fill flash on the faces this would be a really nice shot.  The hot spots on their backs are a little distracting, but not overwhelming.</td>', 'great subject.  If you could have put a little fill flash on the faces this would be a really nice shot.  The hot spots on their backs are a little distracting, but not overwhelming.', '2006-01-30 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103518, 283881, 25464, '<td valign="top">Waaaay over processed.  The blue is very unnatural and the sharpening is making it look like a pen and ink drawing.</td>', 'Waaaay over processed.  The blue is very unnatural and the sharpening is making it look like a pen and ink drawing.', '2006-01-30 20:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103580, 285466, 46020, '<td valign="top">I <b>REALLY</b> wish this was 640 pixels wide!  I would have scored it higher. . . . <i>Maybe</i>.</td>', 'I REALLY wish this was 640 pixels wide!  I would have scored it higher. . . . Maybe.', '2006-01-30 20:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103605, 284949, 16106, '<td valign="top">wow, great capture, the colors of the duck''s wing really is set off by the lilly pads. Good focus and DOF. i wouls have liked to see him a bit less cramped up in the corner on the framing, but you get what you get with birds on the wing and this one is a honey. Top ten.</td>', 'wow, great capture, the colors of the duck''s wing really is set off by the lilly pads. Good focus and DOF. i wouls have liked to see him a bit less cramped up in the corner on the framing, but you get what you get with birds on the wing and this one is a honey. Top ten.', '2006-01-30 20:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103628, 285305, 46020, '<td valign="top">Wow tough, beautiful shot.<br/> <br/>Good luck in this challenge!</td>', 'Wow tough, beautiful shot. Good luck in this challenge!', '2006-01-30 20:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103773, 285064, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites in this challenge.  Love the detail of the critter, the pose, the background.  All very good.  Correction - definitely my favorite in this challenge - I so hope it ribbons!  Good luck!  I just love this guy.</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites in this challenge.  Love the detail of the critter, the pose, the background.  All very good.  Correction - definitely my favorite in this challenge - I so hope it ribbons!  Good luck!  I just love this guy.', '2006-01-30 21:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103787, 285412, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and I like the way the shadows of the reeds describe the curvature of the bird''s body, but the lighting puzzles me. If you took this at night then it is an amazing job color balancing, if this was taken by daylight then you burned the edges so much that the pool of remaining light is as much of a feature of the shot as the bird. Either way it detracts form the elegant form of tthe bird.</td>', 'Nice capture and I like the way the shadows of the reeds describe the curvature of the bird''s body, but the lighting puzzles me. If you took this at night then it is an amazing job color balancing, if this was taken by daylight then you burned the edges so much that the pool of remaining light is as much of a feature of the shot as the bird. Either way it detracts form the elegant form of tthe bird.', '2006-01-30 21:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103806, 283261, 48717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus, composition, contrasting colors and exposure.  One of my tops.</td>', 'Beautiful focus, composition, contrasting colors and exposure.  One of my tops.', '2006-01-30 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103853, 285337, 46020, '<td valign="top">There are some that say arachnids DNMC.  I am not one of them.  However, I wish this was better focused.</td>', 'There are some that say arachnids DNMC.  I am not one of them.  However, I wish this was better focused.', '2006-01-30 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
