(2104153, 284080, 40912, '<td valign="top">I scored this image low because, while it has the potential to be a good shot, nothing is in focus. It almost looks like a grasshopper on top of a bigger grasshopper, on top of a rock or tree. I am not sure what the curving line is exactly, though it seems to be a blade of grass. This could have been a really neat shot if the grasshopper(s) were in focus. Especially if it is two grasshoppers. :) One other suggestion: One of the edges of your picture should be the largest size allowed by the contest: 640 pixels. Good luck with future challenges!</td>', 'I scored this image low because, while it has the potential to be a good shot, nothing is in focus. It almost looks like a grasshopper on top of a bigger grasshopper, on top of a rock or tree. I am not sure what the curving line is exactly, though it seems to be a blade of grass. This could have been a really neat shot if the grasshopper(s) were in focus. Especially if it is two grasshoppers. :) One other suggestion: One of the edges of your picture should be the largest size allowed by the contest: 640 pixels. Good luck with future challenges!', '2006-01-31 00:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104184, 285410, 29269, '<td valign="top">A little too soft... shooting in the snow is always challenging, as the metering may be off. This one is reasonably well done, although it is somewhat blown in parts.<br/>Nice catch and nice take on the challenge. Quality isn''t there to warrant higher score than 5 though.</td>', 'A little too soft... shooting in the snow is always challenging, as the metering may be off. This one is reasonably well done, although it is somewhat blown in parts.Nice catch and nice take on the challenge. Quality isn''t there to warrant higher score than 5 though.', '2006-01-31 00:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104186, 285666, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great catch!</td>', 'Great catch!', '2006-01-31 00:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104214, 285361, 38127, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2006-01-31 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104302, 283907, 40912, '<td valign="top">While this is actually a good shot, it does not meet the criteria set in the challenge rules: <br/>For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment.<br/>I get your point, because of your title, but the title can only carry it so far. As for this particular image, it''s well-focused and the model stands out well against the background. Sorry to see it used in the wrong challenge. Good luck with future challenges!</td>', 'While this is actually a good shot, it does not meet the criteria set in the challenge rules: For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment.I get your point, because of your title, but the title can only carry it so far. As for this particular image, it''s well-focused and the model stands out well against the background. Sorry to see it used in the wrong challenge. Good luck with future challenges!', '2006-01-31 02:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104306, 283713, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love this photo... the focus is great.. the lighting is more great..the background perfect and there is even a sparkle in the eye - so fine</td>', 'I love this photo... the focus is great.. the lighting is more great..the background perfect and there is even a sparkle in the eye - so fine', '2006-01-31 02:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104309, 285633, 75713, '<td valign="top">wonderful color..... the background is great......focus is good..... I would have liked to see a bit of a sparkle in his/her eye but really a very good photo</td>', 'wonderful color..... the background is great......focus is good..... I would have liked to see a bit of a sparkle in his/her eye but really a very good photo', '2006-01-31 02:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
