(2104352, 285023, 75713, '<td valign="top">so soft.. background very good... focus is nice and crisp on the wings.... would have been nicer if the eye had a little light...... not an easy thing to accomplish for sure</td>', 'so soft.. background very good... focus is nice and crisp on the wings.... would have been nicer if the eye had a little light...... not an easy thing to accomplish for sure', '2006-01-31 02:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
