(2104399, 283673, 40912, '<td valign="top">I thought this seemed like a neat idea. The problem, for me, is that nothing is actually in focus.. except possibly the spot just below the bottom corner of the eye.</td>', 'I thought this seemed like a neat idea. The problem, for me, is that nothing is actually in focus.. except possibly the spot just below the bottom corner of the eye.', '2006-01-31 03:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104449, 284948, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - two birds, good focus, great composition, nice motion blur.  Well done all round!</td>', 'Great action shot - two birds, good focus, great composition, nice motion blur.  Well done all round!', '2006-01-31 04:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104451, 285740, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, for me at least, the background takes over and the deer become insignificant.  That would be fine for a landscape shot but it really doesn''t show the wildlife to the full potential - especially with barbed wire cutting through the necks.</td>', 'Unfortunately, for me at least, the background takes over and the deer become insignificant.  That would be fine for a landscape shot but it really doesn''t show the wildlife to the full potential - especially with barbed wire cutting through the necks.', '2006-01-31 04:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104452, 284884, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the close crop, and with so much black in the photo the border works pretty well.  It''s a shame the shot is a bit soft.</td>', 'I love the close crop, and with so much black in the photo the border works pretty well.  It''s a shame the shot is a bit soft.', '2006-01-31 04:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104453, 285491, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the attitude in this shot, and when I then read your title I laughed - very appropriate.  The composition is good and the simple blue background works really well to keep the focus on the bird.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the attitude in this shot, and when I then read your title I laughed - very appropriate.  The composition is good and the simple blue background works really well to keep the focus on the bird.  Well done!', '2006-01-31 04:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104454, 285697, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in this shot, and the composition works quite well too.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the detail in this shot, and the composition works quite well too.  Good job.', '2006-01-31 04:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104456, 285115, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the soft muted colours in this shot.  Personally I would have liked more detail/sharpness though.  It looks like it might respond well to sharpening in an editor - there''s no major blur or anything.</td>', 'I really like the composition and the soft muted colours in this shot.  Personally I would have liked more detail/sharpness though.  It looks like it might respond well to sharpening in an editor - there''s no major blur or anything.', '2006-01-31 04:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104457, 285440, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - the composition / cropping works really well.  The shot looks a little noisy and soft though.  Some work in a program like photoshop (or even picasa) would probably do wonders for this shot.</td>', 'Good work - the composition / cropping works really well.  The shot looks a little noisy and soft though.  Some work in a program like photoshop (or even picasa) would probably do wonders for this shot.', '2006-01-31 04:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
