(2104459, 284574, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like your framing of this shot - placing the bird well into the corner works well although I would have made the gap below and to the left of the bird more equal.</td>', 'I like your framing of this shot - placing the bird well into the corner works well although I would have made the gap below and to the left of the bird more equal.', '2006-01-31 04:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
