(2104656, 285388, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture, getting this owl out in the open like this!  Wonderful camouflage it has.  Nice focus and clarity.  Didn''t oversharpen.  Looks like a glint of light in the eyes...did you use fill-in flash?  Just curious.  Only nitpick is the centering of the subject but it''s not costing you anything in scoring points from me.  One of my top 3 picks.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)</td>', 'Very cool capture, getting this owl out in the open like this!  Wonderful camouflage it has.  Nice focus and clarity.  Didn''t oversharpen.  Looks like a glint of light in the eyes...did you use fill-in flash?  Just curious.  Only nitpick is the centering of the subject but it''s not costing you anything in scoring points from me.  One of my top 3 picks. Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)', '2006-01-31 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
