(2106165, 285474, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love those ears! This could appear in one of those funny caption contests and get some hillarious entries. Makes me smile</td>', 'Love those ears! This could appear in one of those funny caption contests and get some hillarious entries. Makes me smile', '2006-01-31 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106170, 285292, 46020, '<td valign="top">Bears should be hybernating right now yes?</td>', 'Bears should be hybernating right now yes?', '2006-01-31 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106172, 285060, 42984, '<td valign="top">The lighting is cool, I''m having trouble either because its just a little OOF or the subject in frame is too small.</td>', 'The lighting is cool, I''m having trouble either because its just a little OOF or the subject in frame is too small.', '2006-01-31 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106177, 284343, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice difficult capture.  Criticism; obviously opportune, but sharper/more definition make this even better in my opinion.  ''If only'' the ''foot'' not cropped, but this is likely what you had to work with.  Good composition and nice colors.</td>', '7 - Nice difficult capture.  Criticism; obviously opportune, but sharper/more definition make this even better in my opinion.  ''If only'' the ''foot'' not cropped, but this is likely what you had to work with.  Good composition and nice colors.', '2006-01-31 17:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106182, 284997, 42984, '<td valign="top">Mmm .. colours are terrific. That low light and the water detail really give depth that makes this start to work. If you had enough in the frame, I''d like to have seen the subject bought onto the thirds interasection as I think it would have scored even higher, some of the impact is lost and its too good for that.</td>', 'Mmm .. colours are terrific. That low light and the water detail really give depth that makes this start to work. If you had enough in the frame, I''d like to have seen the subject bought onto the thirds interasection as I think it would have scored even higher, some of the impact is lost and its too good for that.', '2006-01-31 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106183, 285623, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice, good coloring and background.  Nice composition.  Criticism; lost me on the title but matters not, just ''even sharper'' and even ''more pop'', make this ''even better'' (obviously), but camera/lens dependent as well as opportunity.  Maybe a fraction more space above the head, depending what you had to work with, of course, but not sure, ''works'' well as is.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very nice, good coloring and background.  Nice composition.  Criticism; lost me on the title but matters not, just ''even sharper'' and even ''more pop'', make this ''even better'' (obviously), but camera/lens dependent as well as opportunity.  Maybe a fraction more space above the head, depending what you had to work with, of course, but not sure, ''works'' well as is.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-31 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106185, 283713, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Like the lighting.  Very nice composition.  Criticism; whilst I like the ''effect'' of those wings in the main focus and the softness to the other areas of the cardinal, just a fraction sharper, or better, a ''wider'' DOF/focal area (lens dependent/etc likely of course), more ''glint'' in the eye, possibly also 640 height too and incorporating more ''context'', for a little more balance within the composition, would have made this even better in my opinion, but difficult to ''get it all''.  Otherwise ''as is'' but trying to ''somehow'' accentuate the effect of those slightly raised wings/etc, if that makes sense.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Like the lighting.  Very nice composition.  Criticism; whilst I like the ''effect'' of those wings in the main focus and the softness to the other areas of the cardinal, just a fraction sharper, or better, a ''wider'' DOF/focal area (lens dependent/etc likely of course), more ''glint'' in the eye, possibly also 640 height too and incorporating more ''context'', for a little more balance within the composition, would have made this even better in my opinion, but difficult to ''get it all''.  Otherwise ''as is'' but trying to ''somehow'' accentuate the effect of those slightly raised wings/etc, if that makes sense.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-31 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106189, 284948, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh, very good capture/opportunity.  The ''baby'' is nice and sharp.  Difficult to get ''it all'' perfect in this.  Criticism; mainly the composition and framing, but obviously depends what you had to work with.  The colors are good, the texture in the nest that is discernible is good.  To be able to get true ''stop motion'' on that father(?) (and the detail on the bug(?) in it''s mouth is good), is, I guess, lens/camera dependent.  Just a little more context/space for this shot (again, if you had it) may have made this even better in my opinion.  640 height too, likely.  Save for a different angle/perspective (retrospective obviously), not much to be done about the green behind ''father'', which while makes this a more colorful shot overall, perhaps detracts slightly from the ''father'' and the impact of this capture.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for ''difficulty''.</td>', '8 - Oh, very good capture/opportunity.  The ''baby'' is nice and sharp.  Difficult to get ''it all'' perfect in this.  Criticism; mainly the composition and framing, but obviously depends what you had to work with.  The colors are good, the texture in the nest that is discernible is good.  To be able to get true ''stop motion'' on that father(?) (and the detail on the bug(?) in it''s mouth is good), is, I guess, lens/camera dependent.  Just a little more context/space for this shot (again, if you had it) may have made this even better in my opinion.  640 height too, likely.  Save for a different angle/perspective (retrospective obviously), not much to be done about the green behind ''father'', which while makes this a more colorful shot overall, perhaps detracts slightly from the ''father'' and the impact of this capture.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for ''difficulty''.', '2006-01-31 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106192, 283907, 14155, '<td valign="top">:))</td>', ':))', '2006-01-31 17:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106196, 283713, 42984, '<td valign="top">What a pity you couldn''t get her crystal sharp because the underbody light is just lovely</td>', 'What a pity you couldn''t get her crystal sharp because the underbody light is just lovely', '2006-01-31 17:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106202, 284524, 14155, '<td valign="top">great photo, love the colors!</td>', 'great photo, love the colors!', '2006-01-31 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106206, 285000, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great shot and great compsition. The tonal values are all complimentary to the background and the subject. I don''t know how this will score because it''s not ''cute'' but this is a very very good technically perfect wildlife capture - worthy of any orthinological magazine</td>', 'Great shot and great compsition. The tonal values are all complimentary to the background and the subject. I don''t know how this will score because it''s not ''cute'' but this is a very very good technically perfect wildlife capture - worthy of any orthinological magazine', '2006-01-31 17:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106209, 284658, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and sharpness, a little off-centering would balance and appeal to viewers even more.</td>', 'Good clarity and sharpness, a little off-centering would balance and appeal to viewers even more.', '2006-01-31 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106214, 285444, 42984, '<td valign="top">I think this had a huge potential if you''d managed to get some more detail on the bird because the location and the colouring are just lovely. I have the feeling that the subject may be a little bit OOF but its too dark to tell, it might just be the feather structure.</td>', 'I think this had a huge potential if you''d managed to get some more detail on the bird because the location and the colouring are just lovely. I have the feeling that the subject may be a little bit OOF but its too dark to tell, it might just be the feather structure.', '2006-01-31 17:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106216, 285323, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wonderful study of the head and features</td>', 'Wonderful study of the head and features', '2006-01-31 17:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106218, 284537, 42984, '<td valign="top">It''s come on the web as being a little too dark so the lovely subtle skin and fur textures are difficult to see well.</td>', 'It''s come on the web as being a little too dark so the lovely subtle skin and fur textures are difficult to see well.', '2006-01-31 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106219, 285311, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well stalked and well taken!</td>', 'Well stalked and well taken!', '2006-01-31 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106222, 284517, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a terrific composition, I just wish I could see the detail in the bird. We''re just drawn to the head forst and then to the amazing cloak and to not be able to really study it is a shame.</td>', 'Wow, this is a terrific composition, I just wish I could see the detail in the bird. We''re just drawn to the head forst and then to the amazing cloak and to not be able to really study it is a shame.', '2006-01-31 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106224, 285305, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture - well done</td>', 'Great motion capture - well done', '2006-01-31 17:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106228, 285327, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice blend of the wild and human civilisation. The white line bugged me first off, but now I like the statement it makes</td>', 'Nice blend of the wild and human civilisation. The white line bugged me first off, but now I like the statement it makes', '2006-01-31 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106233, 285692, 42984, '<td valign="top">Just a little too indistinct to really work which is a shame as the colours are great and the capture of the formation is wonderful</td>', 'Just a little too indistinct to really work which is a shame as the colours are great and the capture of the formation is wonderful', '2006-01-31 17:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106236, 285633, 42984, '<td valign="top">The different perspective is refreshing. The colour captured by the tail is amazing as is the shallow depth of field</td>', 'The different perspective is refreshing. The colour captured by the tail is amazing as is the shallow depth of field', '2006-01-31 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106239, 285123, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice color and capture.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''darkness'' adds to this image, but perhaps a tweaking of colors, not sure.  A bit more definition (although good as is), but that may have required a different angle/perspective and this is obviously ''opportune'' so who knows.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Nice color and capture.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''darkness'' adds to this image, but perhaps a tweaking of colors, not sure.  A bit more definition (although good as is), but that may have required a different angle/perspective and this is obviously ''opportune'' so who knows.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-31 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106243, 285318, 42984, '<td valign="top">The shadows have conspired to block out the interesting detail of the dogs. Your going to get hammered anyway because they''re domestic pets and not wildlife. It always pays to carefully read the Challenge Description.</td>', 'The shadows have conspired to block out the interesting detail of the dogs. Your going to get hammered anyway because they''re domestic pets and not wildlife. It always pays to carefully read the Challenge Description.', '2006-01-31 17:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106248, 284227, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good capture in a difficult setting</td>', 'Good capture in a difficult setting', '2006-01-31 17:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106249, 285464, 42984, '<td valign="top">You''re getting the beady eye there, sure its not a kiwi swan?</td>', 'You''re getting the beady eye there, sure its not a kiwi swan?', '2006-01-31 17:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106254, 283990, 42984, '<td valign="top">This si a terrific shot. It has the colour balance of the ducks environment just right.. The surrounding colours are subdued which has allowed the duck to stand out. Good clarity too. A couple of things to look out for. Use the thirds rule to get a stronger composition, it would work wonders for your score here. Secondly, your image is way too small and makes it very difficult to study. The 430x384 size really doesn''t give you much chance. If you hit the 150kb barrier, you need to read up on varying the JPEG compression ratio</td>', 'This si a terrific shot. It has the colour balance of the ducks environment just right.. The surrounding colours are subdued which has allowed the duck to stand out. Good clarity too. A couple of things to look out for. Use the thirds rule to get a stronger composition, it would work wonders for your score here. Secondly, your image is way too small and makes it very difficult to study. The 430x384 size really doesn''t give you much chance. If you hit the 150kb barrier, you need to read up on varying the JPEG compression ratio', '2006-01-31 17:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106261, 284945, 42984, '<td valign="top">I bet you busted a gut to get near this bird. It''s a shame that it is still too hard to even see it to appreciate it.</td>', 'I bet you busted a gut to get near this bird. It''s a shame that it is still too hard to even see it to appreciate it.', '2006-01-31 17:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106264, 284420, 52510, '<td valign="top">Great Image, I love the line up of the Deer</td>', 'Great Image, I love the line up of the Deer', '2006-01-31 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106289, 285407, 42984, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that B&amp;W is appropriate for wildlife when you have the option of colour. The study of wildlife is to see the colours and habitat as nature paints them. This is a great art shot, one I''d be happy to have on my wall.</td>', 'I don''t know that B&W is appropriate for wildlife when you have the option of colour. The study of wildlife is to see the colours and habitat as nature paints them. This is a great art shot, one I''d be happy to have on my wall.', '2006-01-31 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
