(2106359, 285742, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I would have love a bit more DOF towards the snake''s nose.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I would have love a bit more DOF towards the snake''s nose.', '2006-01-31 18:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106362, 284238, 42984, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t make the front page ....</td>', 'If this doesn''t make the front page ....', '2006-01-31 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106366, 284372, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - .. Wow.  Different.  Not sure on those eyes/flash reflection but I think this shot likely ''grows on you''.  Not sure if this is ''natural environs'' or not, but does look realistic at any rate.  Matters not to my vote.  Criticism; difficult, maybe more height for added impact for ''here'', not sure.  Maybe a tweaking of colors and or sharpening to get the cat to pop more - the eyes, not sure, as they make this shot unique.  Perhaps a little more subtle, again not sure.  I like the centered composition.  Just if it had more ''pop''/definition and ''drama'', ''somehow'', make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for ''unique factor''.</td>', '8 - .. Wow.  Different.  Not sure on those eyes/flash reflection but I think this shot likely ''grows on you''.  Not sure if this is ''natural environs'' or not, but does look realistic at any rate.  Matters not to my vote.  Criticism; difficult, maybe more height for added impact for ''here'', not sure.  Maybe a tweaking of colors and or sharpening to get the cat to pop more - the eyes, not sure, as they make this shot unique.  Perhaps a little more subtle, again not sure.  I like the centered composition.  Just if it had more ''pop''/definition and ''drama'', ''somehow'', make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 8 from 7, mainly for ''unique factor''.', '2006-01-31 18:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106371, 285648, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Fairly good capture of an obvious opportune moment with these two.  Criticism; the obvious aside, not much.</td>', '7 - Fairly good capture of an obvious opportune moment with these two.  Criticism; the obvious aside, not much.', '2006-01-31 18:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106372, 283077, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great isolation of the subject and the lighting is just superb</td>', 'Great isolation of the subject and the lighting is just superb', '2006-01-31 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106374, 283713, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t captute the cardinal sitting on a branch rather than on a feeder stand.  Focus is a little soft through the head/beak.  Nice job with the light.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t captute the cardinal sitting on a branch rather than on a feeder stand.  Focus is a little soft through the head/beak.  Nice job with the light.', '2006-01-31 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106375, 285546, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh... Very nice capture.  Criticism; difficult, depending what you had to work with perhaps a little more space to the left of it''s tail.  Even sharper, more ''pop'' and a tweaking of colors slightly may have made this even better in my opinion.  A little ''blown''/overexposed in areas but, not an easy shot.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Oh... Very nice capture.  Criticism; difficult, depending what you had to work with perhaps a little more space to the left of it''s tail.  Even sharper, more ''pop'' and a tweaking of colors slightly may have made this even better in my opinion.  A little ''blown''/overexposed in areas but, not an easy shot.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-31 18:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106386, 285123, 11738, '<td valign="top">Superb image.  National Geographic caliber capture.  The composition is very good and the light is just right.  Hope to see you in top-3.  Good luck.</td>', 'Superb image.  National Geographic caliber capture.  The composition is very good and the light is just right.  Hope to see you in top-3.  Good luck.', '2006-01-31 18:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106388, 285377, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good and unusual.  Criticism; ''if only'' the top of the head/crown/feathers were not cut/cropped, make this much better in my opinion, even with the wings (even though seemingly fully spread) cut.  640 and just more context (if you had it, obviously) also would have given this extra.  Good colors and background.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for ''unique factor''.</td>', '7 - Good and unusual.  Criticism; ''if only'' the top of the head/crown/feathers were not cut/cropped, make this much better in my opinion, even with the wings (even though seemingly fully spread) cut.  640 and just more context (if you had it, obviously) also would have given this extra.  Good colors and background.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for ''unique factor''.', '2006-01-31 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106390, 284948, 11738, '<td valign="top">Superb action shot.  One of the few dynamic shots in this challenge.  Great work and good luck.</td>', 'Superb action shot.  One of the few dynamic shots in this challenge.  Great work and good luck.', '2006-01-31 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106393, 285316, 11738, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but the light, even though it''s all natural, is a bit harsh.  I always find that bird pics come out better when slightly overcast diffused light is present.  Focus looks like it''s bang on.  Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture, but the light, even though it''s all natural, is a bit harsh.  I always find that bird pics come out better when slightly overcast diffused light is present.  Focus looks like it''s bang on.  Good capture.', '2006-01-31 18:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106394, 285471, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture and composition.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop at the top to eliminate that top branch tip, not sure.  Difficult, but a bit more definition/detail in the bird.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Nice capture and composition.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop at the top to eliminate that top branch tip, not sure.  Difficult, but a bit more definition/detail in the bird.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2006-01-31 18:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106395, 285666, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Mainly for the ''capture'', including obvious ''wild'' background ''view''/location, which likely meant more difficulty.  Criticism; difficult with the ''opportunity'' but sharper, more ''pop'', etc.  Perhaps a little more space ''above'', for added balance, depending what you had to work with originally, of course.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for ''difficulty''.</td>', '7 - Mainly for the ''capture'', including obvious ''wild'' background ''view''/location, which likely meant more difficulty.  Criticism; difficult with the ''opportunity'' but sharper, more ''pop'', etc.  Perhaps a little more space ''above'', for added balance, depending what you had to work with originally, of course.  Up to 7 from 6, mainly for ''difficulty''.', '2006-01-31 18:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106399, 284926, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; sharper with more discernable texture and 640 (in this case width) make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in composition, not sure, as ''works'' as is.  Up to 6 from 5.</td>', '6 - Good potential.  Nice colors.  Criticism; sharper with more discernable texture and 640 (in this case width) make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in composition, not sure, as ''works'' as is.  Up to 6 from 5.', '2006-01-31 18:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106402, 284517, 11738, '<td valign="top">Such a tight crop does not indicate if the bird is living in it''s natural environment or in a cage.  A looser crop would have been more appropriate as per the challenge description.</td>', 'Such a tight crop does not indicate if the bird is living in it''s natural environment or in a cage.  A looser crop would have been more appropriate as per the challenge description.', '2006-01-31 18:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106405, 285388, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is so centered.  A different crop would have made for a more interesting image.</td>', 'Too bad this is so centered.  A different crop would have made for a more interesting image.', '2006-01-31 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106439, 283670, 46020, '<td valign="top">You are allowed to have 640 pixels on the longest side of your image.  I''d like to know why you chose to give us only 335 pixels on your longest side.  IMO you should always submit the largest possible photo.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'You are allowed to have 640 pixels on the longest side of your image.  I''d like to know why you chose to give us only 335 pixels on your longest side.  IMO you should always submit the largest possible photo. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-31 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106445, 284620, 46020, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop and some work on levels would have made this pic more interesting.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I think a tighter crop and some work on levels would have made this pic more interesting. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-31 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106458, 284460, 46020, '<td valign="top">I''m sure a crop using the rule of thirds and a curves adjustment would have made this shot really jump.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I''m sure a crop using the rule of thirds and a curves adjustment would have made this shot really jump. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-31 19:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
