(2106682, 283218, 46020, '<td valign="top">Stared at this pic on and off for a few days now and have yet to see an animal in this shot.  I have concluded that you must be going for the brown ribbon.  I suppose it''s possible that your art is just way above my feeble mind. . . . NAH, You''re going for the brown! I''m just sorry I can''t help you out more by giving you lower than a 1.</td>', 'Stared at this pic on and off for a few days now and have yet to see an animal in this shot.  I have concluded that you must be going for the brown ribbon.  I suppose it''s possible that your art is just way above my feeble mind. . . . NAH, You''re going for the brown! I''m just sorry I can''t help you out more by giving you lower than a 1.', '2006-01-31 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
