(2106687, 284227, 42377, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really had great imagination in capturing this shot.  The picture is a bit muddled by the out of focus portions close up, but I still like it.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, you really had great imagination in capturing this shot.  The picture is a bit muddled by the out of focus portions close up, but I still like it.  Nice work.', '2006-01-31 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
