(2107680, 283881, 50299, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented, very much appreciated!  I had alot of fun with this and think I''ve learned just how addicting it really is to check the site to see my score go up and down! lol<br/>I was above 6 for awhile but was happy to place in the top 100.  I didn''t expect that.  I''m glad to see I didn''t have too many 1, 2, or 3s.  <br/> <br/>I''ll work on my sharpening for the next competition.</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented, very much appreciated!  I had alot of fun with this and think I''ve learned just how addicting it really is to check the site to see my score go up and down! lolI was above 6 for awhile but was happy to place in the top 100.  I didn''t expect that.  I''m glad to see I didn''t have too many 1, 2, or 3s.   I''ll work on my sharpening for the next competition.', '2006-02-01 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2107684, 284703, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is art !!! Congratulations on another ribbon. Terrific shot.</td>', 'This is art !!! Congratulations on another ribbon. Terrific shot.', '2006-02-01 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2107694, 285592, 49447, '<td valign="top">I want to Thank all those that voted and made comments on my first entry. I agree with those that commented it was too dark.  I entered this on the last day and essentially just did a Basic Edit.  Levels, Crop, Brightness/Contrast, Saturation, USM and resize.  I did clone to enhance that "eye glint", and in hindsight, I probably should have dodged some of the left flank to lighten it up.  But, Live and Learn.  Once again, thanks to all that commented.</td>', 'I want to Thank all those that voted and made comments on my first entry. I agree with those that commented it was too dark.  I entered this on the last day and essentially just did a Basic Edit.  Levels, Crop, Brightness/Contrast, Saturation, USM and resize.  I did clone to enhance that "eye glint", and in hindsight, I probably should have dodged some of the left flank to lighten it up.  But, Live and Learn.  Once again, thanks to all that commented.', '2006-02-01 00:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2107710, 284703, 27605, '<td valign="top">Congratulations HARVEY!  Awesome shot, and what a score.... darn close to EIGHT!  Happy for you!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 00:40:48.</i></td>', 'Congratulations HARVEY!  Awesome shot, and what a score.... darn close to EIGHT!  Happy for you!', '2006-02-01 00:36:27.000000', '2006-02-01 00:40:48.000000', 0),
