(2108909, 285472, 30222, '<td valign="top">both the eyes didnt look good and the reddish around his right is not faked i hate to say<br/>think nobody got this hint but it was meant as a reference to that movie SIN CITY wich was in B/W with just the color Red now and than (as a symbol for violence i guess) and the moods in this image and that movie are alike here for my sense thats the good thing<br/>Great movie by the way</td>', 'both the eyes didnt look good and the reddish around his right is not faked i hate to saythink nobody got this hint but it was meant as a reference to that movie SIN CITY wich was in B/W with just the color Red now and than (as a symbol for violence i guess) and the moods in this image and that movie are alike here for my sense thats the good thingGreat movie by the way', '2006-02-01 06:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
