(2114184, 285740, 40867, '<td valign="top">Although i mentioned the wire, it was not a criticism of what i considered to be a great photo of wildlife where its supposed to be. we dont always see lots of detail on animals because we cant get close enough.I scored a 9 ,should have been 10 but im jealous that you live in that beautiful state,anyone who''s been there would recognise it.</td>', 'Although i mentioned the wire, it was not a criticism of what i considered to be a great photo of wildlife where its supposed to be. we dont always see lots of detail on animals because we cant get close enough.I scored a 9 ,should have been 10 but im jealous that you live in that beautiful state,anyone who''s been there would recognise it.', '2006-02-02 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
