(2128145, 285311, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>" THAT''S RIGHT, THE BUCK STOPS HERE!" is a good Wildlife shot.  I am really glad to see a real Wildlife shot as opposed to the tons of zoo shots.  I love how natural shot is.  Its like watching a nature show and you can hear the quite voice in the background saying "through the trees we spot a buck in its natural habit".  The only things I would try is to tighten the crop on the left just a little so that you don''t have such a bright white spot on the bottom left corner.  Also the ear seems a little bright.  I don''t know if it over blown or the contrast to bring out the tree is just a little much.  The trees are so amazing to show the natural environment.  I really am suprised I did not see this shot place higher, it really is a differnt from the rest and stands out.</td>', '*Critique Club* " THAT''S RIGHT, THE BUCK STOPS HERE!" is a good Wildlife shot.  I am really glad to see a real Wildlife shot as opposed to the tons of zoo shots.  I love how natural shot is.  Its like watching a nature show and you can hear the quite voice in the background saying "through the trees we spot a buck in its natural habit".  The only things I would try is to tighten the crop on the left just a little so that you don''t have such a bright white spot on the bottom left corner.  Also the ear seems a little bright.  I don''t know if it over blown or the contrast to bring out the tree is just a little much.  The trees are so amazing to show the natural environment.  I really am suprised I did not see this shot place higher, it really is a differnt from the rest and stands out.', '2006-02-06 22:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
