(2133092, 284142, 42792, '<td valign="top">Another nice finish!  He looks real contented to let you snap away.  Agree with the other comment about the border tho'' and the snow looks slightly over-blown.  I''d maybe reduce just a wee bit of what seems like an overall blue tint.</td>', 'Another nice finish!  He looks real contented to let you snap away.  Agree with the other comment about the border tho'' and the snow looks slightly over-blown.  I''d maybe reduce just a wee bit of what seems like an overall blue tint.', '2006-02-08 08:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134590, 285388, 39850, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shes_trouble:</b></div><hr/><i> ..... I had been out earlier in the day taking b&amp;w''s of the kids playing in the snow and truly did not have the time to do much more than a quick metering, then made sure I got atleast 1 photo of him before he flew off.  So, it''s originally taken in b&amp;w - no fixing that ;P..... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not sure on the E500, and may well be too late now (wiped memory card) - but, doesn''t the camera take 3 versions of the same shot? - just wondering if one might be a color.. not sure.</td>', 'Originally posted by shes_trouble: ..... I had been out earlier in the day taking b&w''s of the kids playing in the snow and truly did not have the time to do much more than a quick metering, then made sure I got atleast 1 photo of him before he flew off.  So, it''s originally taken in b&w - no fixing that ;P.....   Not sure on the E500, and may well be too late now (wiped memory card) - but, doesn''t the camera take 3 versions of the same shot? - just wondering if one might be a color.. not sure.', '2006-02-08 16:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137851, 285644, 72317, '<td valign="top">I hate most bird and squirrel pictures because theyre rediculously over rated and too easy to shoot, but this looks like a fantastic shot to me! It would have turned out a bit better if you had focused it a little better (although you dont want the bird to fly away, of course) or if you had first saved it as a BMP and sharpened it and then saved it as a JPEG, then perhaps it wouldnt have turned out as fuzzy.. Still, I would have given it an 8-9..</td>', 'I hate most bird and squirrel pictures because theyre rediculously over rated and too easy to shoot, but this looks like a fantastic shot to me! It would have turned out a bit better if you had focused it a little better (although you dont want the bird to fly away, of course) or if you had first saved it as a BMP and sharpened it and then saved it as a JPEG, then perhaps it wouldnt have turned out as fuzzy.. Still, I would have given it an 8-9..', '2006-02-09 18:27:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137874, 285625, 72317, '<td valign="top">Im surprised with the detail and sharpness of the grass, its spectacular! Also, I like crows.. Definately a plus! This is a wonderful picture, and it belongs in black and white.. Just the mood of it seems best suited in black and white.. Wonderful picture!</td>', 'Im surprised with the detail and sharpness of the grass, its spectacular! Also, I like crows.. Definately a plus! This is a wonderful picture, and it belongs in black and white.. Just the mood of it seems best suited in black and white.. Wonderful picture!', '2006-02-09 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137914, 285474, 72317, '<td valign="top">Colorfully entertaining picture! Wonderfully done! I, for one, like the sharpness of the backround. Everything looks perfect. This would have been a ten, for me!</td>', 'Colorfully entertaining picture! Wonderfully done! I, for one, like the sharpness of the backround. Everything looks perfect. This would have been a ten, for me!', '2006-02-09 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137976, 285410, 72317, '<td valign="top">Even though I could totally understand not wanting to be close to the frozen deer, a closer picture would have captured the over all emotion of the whole picture.. But also, I was a bit surprised to see a dead deer at first.. But honestly, It isn''t about the object in the picture.. The color of the background.. It''s about taking a good photograph.. Some people, animal activists or not, need to realize that that''s what its all about! It''s not like you killed the deer yourself, anyways..</td>', 'Even though I could totally understand not wanting to be close to the frozen deer, a closer picture would have captured the over all emotion of the whole picture.. But also, I was a bit surprised to see a dead deer at first.. But honestly, It isn''t about the object in the picture.. The color of the background.. It''s about taking a good photograph.. Some people, animal activists or not, need to realize that that''s what its all about! It''s not like you killed the deer yourself, anyways..', '2006-02-09 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137989, 285402, 72317, '<td valign="top">Very brave! Those things spit some nasty lugies from up to 20 feet away! Jeez!</td>', 'Very brave! Those things spit some nasty lugies from up to 20 feet away! Jeez!', '2006-02-09 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138016, 285131, 72317, '<td valign="top">While some may argue, I like the spaciousness of the photo, as it gives it a feeling of standing out a bit, and a lonliness.. But yes, the focus could have been better (If it could have been helped, that is) and this is just my preferrance, the photo looks amazing as it is, but if only the sky had been blue that day.. Blue water would have made it better in my eyes.. But color itself is nothing to judge..</td>', 'While some may argue, I like the spaciousness of the photo, as it gives it a feeling of standing out a bit, and a lonliness.. But yes, the focus could have been better (If it could have been helped, that is) and this is just my preferrance, the photo looks amazing as it is, but if only the sky had been blue that day.. Blue water would have made it better in my eyes.. But color itself is nothing to judge..', '2006-02-09 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138027, 284997, 72317, '<td valign="top">Underrated.. I cant stand it when people mark down a shot that they know they couldnt have taken nearly as good themselves.. I see nothing wrong with this picture as it belongs the way it is! Fantastic!</td>', 'Underrated.. I cant stand it when people mark down a shot that they know they couldnt have taken nearly as good themselves.. I see nothing wrong with this picture as it belongs the way it is! Fantastic!', '2006-02-09 19:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
