(2138102, 284750, 72317, '<td valign="top">The comments you have so far seem divided.. Some like color others like the way it is.. I think this photograph belongs the way it is.. It''s an example of wonderful photography and great use of b/w</td>', 'The comments you have so far seem divided.. Some like color others like the way it is.. I think this photograph belongs the way it is.. It''s an example of wonderful photography and great use of b/w', '2006-02-09 19:28:51.000000', NULL, 0),
