(2455590, 284703, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''ve been checking out your bird shots. Man, you''re good at shooting birds. Some great work you produce of our feathered friends.</td>', 'I''ve been checking out your bird shots. Man, you''re good at shooting birds. Some great work you produce of our feathered friends.', '2006-05-25 03:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2503562, 284238, 48228, '<td valign="top">I also feel that you were robbed with this image, as it deserved a much higher score..... i don''t think these are ugly birds, but a wonderful textured and colorful bird. I really like the play of light and dark, on this image.</td>', 'I also feel that you were robbed with this image, as it deserved a much higher score..... i don''t think these are ugly birds, but a wonderful textured and colorful bird. I really like the play of light and dark, on this image.', '2006-06-09 23:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2503578, 284238, 53147, '<td valign="top">I almost always take a pic of these birds when we go to the zoo because I think they just look cool but I have yet to come out with one that is even close to having the impact this one has. Great shot.</td>', 'I almost always take a pic of these birds when we go to the zoo because I think they just look cool but I have yet to come out with one that is even close to having the impact this one has. Great shot.', '2006-06-09 23:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
